INSERT INTO `ai_analyst_messages` (`id`, `conversation_id`, `role`, `content`, `metrics_called`, `metrics_results`, `chart_config`, `created_at`) VALUES
(1, 1, 'user', 'Lead conversion rate this month vs last?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 12:22:27'),
(2, 1, 'assistant', 'I can provide lead conversion rates for the last 30 days and the last 90 days, but I cannot specifically isolate \"this month\" versus \"last month\" with the available tools. Would you like to see the conversion rates for the last 30 days and last 90 days?', '[]', NULL, 'null', '2026-07-22 12:22:34'),
(3, 1, 'user', 'yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 12:22:50'),
(4, 1, 'assistant', '### Lead Conversion Rate Analysis\n\nHere\'s a comparison of the lead conversion rates:\n\n| Metric                 | Last 30 Days | Last 90 Days |\n| :--------------------- | :----------- | :----------- |\n| **Lead Conversion Rate** | 30%          | 30%          |\n| Converted Leads        | 42           | 42           |\n| Total Leads            | 140          | 140          |\n\n**Key Insights:**\nThe lead conversion rate has been consistent at 30% over both the last 30 days and the last 90 days.\nThe number of converted leads and total leads are identical for both periods, suggesting that all recent lead conversions and new leads occurred within the last 30 days. This could indicate a recent surge in lead generation and conversion activity, or that older data beyond 30 days is not contributing to the conversion metric calculation as expected for the 90-day period.\n\n**Actionable Insight:**\nInvestigate the lead generation and conversion trends from 30 to 90 days ago to understand why the numbers for both periods are identical. This could help identify if there was a period of no leads or conversions, or if there\'s a data anomaly.', '[{\"name\":\"conversion_rate\",\"args\":{\"date_range\":\"30_days\"},\"data\":{\"metric\":\"lead_conversion_rate\",\"date_range\":\"30_days\",\"source_filter\":\"all\",\"channel_filter\":\"all\",\"total_leads\":140,\"converted_leads\":42,\"conversion_rate\":\"30%\",\"raw_rate\":30}},{\"name\":\"conversion_rate\",\"args\":{\"date_range\":\"90_days\"},\"data\":{\"metric\":\"lead_conversion_rate\",\"date_range\":\"90_days\",\"source_filter\":\"all\",\"channel_filter\":\"all\",\"total_leads\":140,\"converted_leads\":42,\"conversion_rate\":\"30%\",\"raw_rate\":30}}]', NULL, 'null', '2026-07-22 12:22:54');
