(10, 'monthly_kpi_summary', '2026-06-22', '2026-07-22', 'Petsfolio demonstrated strong revenue generation over the past 30 days, achieving a gross revenue of **INR 1,140,718.96** from **95 bookings**, with the platform securing **INR 114,071.90** in commission. However, a notable **21.9% booking cancellation rate** (23 cancelled bookings) indicates a potential area for improvement in customer retention or service delivery. On a positive note, cross-sell initiatives show promising results with an overall acceptance rate of **27.9%**.\n\nThe lead generation funnel exhibits a healthy overall conversion rate of **30%**, but performance varies significantly across sources. **Referral leads converted at an excellent 50%**, showcasing the strength of word-of-mouth, while **Meta Ads conversions lagged considerably at 16.1%**. In terms of support health, the average ticket resolution time is manageable at **4 hours overall**, but \"app bug\" related issues present a critical bottleneck, taking an average of **14.5 hours to resolve**, significantly higher than other issue types like \"walker delay\" (1.2 hours).\n\nBased on this 30-day performance, it is recommended that management:\n1.  **Optimize Meta Ads Strategy**: Investigate the lower conversion rate from Meta Ads (16.1%) to refine targeting, ad creatives, or landing page experiences to improve ROI and bring it closer to the performance of other channels.\n2.  **Expedite App Bug Resolutions**: Prioritize the reduction of \"app bug\" resolution times, which currently stand at 14.5 hours. This may involve allocating more dedicated developer resources, improving diagnostic tools, or streamlining the bug fix deployment process to enhance user experience and reduce operational overhead.', '{\"bookings\":{\"metric\":\"bookings_summary\",\"date_range\":\"30_days\",\"service_filter\":\"all\",\"status_filter\":\"all\",\"total_bookings\":95,\"total_revenue_inr\":1033566,\"breakdown\":[{\"service_type\":\"grooming\",\"status\":\"C