(71, 19, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.6783]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.6726]\nBooking Process\nThe Grooming Service booking process includes the following steps:\n1. Select the registered pet.\n2. Choose the Grooming Service.\n3. Select the preferred grooming package.\n4. If Hair Trimming is selected, choose one trimming style.\n5. Select optional add-on services (if required).\n6. Choose the preferred service start date.\n7. Select the preferred service time.\n8. Confirm the service address.\n9. Submit the booking request.\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nGrooming Packages\nThe application offers the following grooming packages.\nBasic Package – 799/-\nIncludes:\n Shampoo Bath\n Blowing\n Combing\nAnti-Tick Bath Package – 899/-\nIncludes:\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\nHair Trimming Package\nUsers can select one of the following trimming styles:\n Semi Trim – 699/-\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.6496]\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nGrooming Service Summary\nSupported Pets\n Dog\n Cat\nGrooming Packages\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n Hair Trimming Package\nHair Trimming Styles\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\nOptional Add-On Services\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.6453]\n Full Trim - 900/-\n Stylish Trim – 1499/-\nOnly one trimming style can be selected for each booking.\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nThese add-ons provide additional care during the grooming session and can be selected based\non the pet parent\'s preferences.\nService Provider Quotation\nOverview\nAfter a Grooming Service request is submitted, the Petsfolio platform automatically shares the\nrequest with nearby eligible and available service providers based on the selected service\nlocation.\nInterested service providers can review the booking request and submit their quotations\nthrough the application.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.6386]\nNot Started\nThe assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\nIn Progress\nThe assigned service provider has started the grooming session.\nApprove Service\nOnce the grooming session has started, pet parents can approve the service if they are satisfied\nwith the service being provided.\nReject Service\nIf the pet parent is not satisfied with the grooming service, they can reject the service through\nthe application and raise their concern.\nTerminate Service\nThe Terminate Service feature allows pet parents to stop an ongoing grooming service before\ncompletion whenever required.\nService Availability\nThe Petsfolio Grooming Service is available for Dogs and Cats.\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified service providers.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.6324]\ntime, choose optional add-on services if required, confirm the service address, and submit the\nbooking request.\n5. What grooming packages are available?\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n Hair Trimming Package\n6. What is included in the Basic Package?\n Shampoo Bath\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.6318]\nNo. Add-on services are optional and charged separately.\n14. Can I book Grooming Service without add-ons?\nYes.\n15. What happens after I submit my Grooming Service request?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n16. Can I compare multiple quotations?\nYes. The application allows you to compare quotations before selecting a service provider.\n17. Can I chat with service providers before confirming my booking?\nYes. You can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nyour booking.\n18. What information is available in a quotation?\nA quotation includes:\n Service Cost\n Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Grooming Service Photos\n Other provider details\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.6297]\n Active Service Tracking\n Call Service Provider\n Cancel Service\n Approve Service\n Reject Service\n Terminate Service\n Booking Notifications\n Secure Online Payment\nPetsfolio Grooming Service – Frequently Asked\nQuestions (FAQs)\n1. What is the Petsfolio Grooming Service?\nPetsfolio Grooming Service provides professional grooming for Dogs and Cats to maintain their\nhygiene, health, and appearance.\n2. Which pets are eligible for the Grooming Service?\nCurrently, Grooming Service is available only for registered Dogs and Cats.\n3. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a Grooming Service.\n4. How do I book a Grooming Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose a grooming package, select the preferred service date and\ntime, choose optional add-on services if required, confirm the service address, and submit the\nbooking request.\n5. What grooming packages are available?\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.6243]\n Blowing\n Combing\n7. What is included in the Anti-Tick Bath Package?\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\n8. What Hair Trimming styles are available?\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\n9. Can I choose multiple Hair Trimming styles?\nNo. Only one Hair Trimming style can be selected for each booking.\n10. Can I choose my preferred service date?\nYes.\n11. Can I choose my preferred service time?\nYes.\n12. What add-on services are available?\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\n13. Are add-on services included in the grooming package?\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.6217]\nYes. The application provides a Call option within the booking details.\n23. Can I cancel my Grooming Service?\nYes. Grooming Services can be cancelled according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\n24. What does \"Not Started\" mean?\nIt indicates that the assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\n25. What does \"In Progress\" mean?\nIt indicates that the grooming session has started.\n26. Can I approve the Grooming Service?\nYes. Once the service has started, you can approve the service if you are satisfied.\n27. Can I reject the Grooming Service?\nYes. If you are not satisfied with the service, you can reject it through the application.\n28. What is the Terminate Service option?\nThe Terminate Service option allows you to stop an ongoing grooming session before\ncompletion.\n29. Can I book Grooming Service for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book Grooming Services for multiple registered pets.\n30. Where is the Petsfolio Grooming Service available?\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Sahil | Phone: 918758396038 | Rep: Rachel Green\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): \r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: \r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hi\nCustomer: Hi\nAI Agent: *Hi there!* 👋 Welcome to **Petsfolio**! I’m your friendly AI assistant here to help you with everything pet care related.\n\nWhether you’re looking to book dog walking, training, pet insurance, or even inquire about Punganur cows, our **Petsfolio Client Application** makes it easy to manage all your pet care needs in one place.\n\nTo get started, please download the app:\n* Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n* iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, register, add your pet, and browse verified service providers to book your desired service! 🐾\nCustomer: I want grooming service\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Hi there!* 👋 Welcome to **Petsfolio**! I’m your friendly AI assistant here to help you with everything pet care related.\n\nWhether you’re looking to book dog walking, training, pet insurance, or even inquire about Punganur cows, our **Petsfolio Client Application** makes it easy to manage all your pet care needs in one place.\n\nTo get started, please download the app:\n* Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n* iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, register, add your pet, and browse verified service providers to book your desired service! 🐾\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"I want grooming service\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Rachel Green will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: I want grooming service', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Hi there!* 👋 Welcome to **Petsfolio**! Great choice! Our **Grooming Service** offers professional grooming for *Dogs* and *Cats* to maintain their hygiene, health, and appearance[1][2].\\n\\n**Available Packages:**\\n- *Basic Package* (₹799): Shampoo Bath, Blowing, Combing[2][6]\\n- *Anti-Tick Bath Package* (₹899): Anti-Dandruff, Anti-Flea, Anti-Tick Treatments[2][7]\\n- *Hair Trimming Package*: Semi Trim (₹699), Full Trim (₹900), Stylish Trim (₹1499) – only one style per booking[2][4][9]\\n\\n**Optional Add-ons:** Ear Cleaning, Nail Clipping, De-shedding, Teeth Cleaning, and more[3][4][9].\\n\\nAfter booking, nearby Verified Service Providers will share quotations you can compare and chat with before confirming[2][7].\\n\\n📲 To book, please download the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\\n• Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en[5]\\n• iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723[5]\\n\\nRegister your pet, select your package, and book your grooming session easily!\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"Grooming Service\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 8\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"grooming\",\n    \"dog\",\n    \"cat\",\n    \"service Inquiry\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User requested grooming service. Provided details on available packages, pricing, add-ons, and booking process. Directed user to download Petsfolio app to book.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 75,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Guide user to download app and register pet\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": 