(87, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.634]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.6201]\nCombing.\n4. Which pets are eligible for the Walking Service?\nCurrently, Walking Service is available only for registered Dogs.\n5. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a walking service.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.6169]\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient walking experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Regular Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nBooking Process\nThe Regular Walking Service booking process includes the following steps:\n1. Select the registered pet.\n2. Choose the Regular Walking Service.\n3. Select the walking frequency.\n4. Select the preferred walk duration.\n5. Choose the walking package.\n6. Select the preferred schedule.\n7. Choose the service start date.\n8. Select the preferred service time.\n9. Choose optional add-on services (if required).\n10. Submit the booking request.\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.609]\nThe Elite Walking Service is a premium dog walking service designed for pet parents who prefer\nenhanced care, priority support, and exclusive service benefits. This service is provided\nexclusively by Petsfolio Certified and Verified Service Providers, ensuring a higher standard of\nprofessionalism, reliability, and service quality.\nUnlike the Regular Walking Service, the Elite Walking Service includes premium benefits such as\n24/7 customer support, Priority Matching with the most suitable service provider, and\ncomplimentary pet care add-ons. The service is designed to deliver a personalized and premium\nwalking experience for pets and their owners.\nEligibility\nThe Elite Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nPremium Benefits\nEvery Elite Walking Service booking includes the following benefits:\n Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.608]\nWalk Duration\nEach walking session can be scheduled for:\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\nThe application offers multiple package durations:\nPackage 	Duration 	Price\nExpress Package 	3 Days 	195/walk\nShort-Term Package 	7 Days 	146/walk\nMid-Term Package 	15 Days 	125/walk\nLong-Term Package 	30 Days 	96/walk\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.6076]\nOverview\nThe Cancel Service feature allows users to cancel an upcoming or active walking service\nwhenever required.\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nWalking Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\nWalking Frequencies\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.6055]\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5987]\n6. Can I book walking services for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book walking services for multiple registered pets.\n7. How do I book a Walking Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose Regular or Elite Walking Service, select the frequency,\nduration, package, schedule, preferred start date, preferred time, optional add-ons, and\ncomplete the booking process.\n8. What walking frequencies are available?\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n9. What walk durations are available?\n 30 Minutes\n 60 Minutes\n10. What packages are available in the Regular Walking\nService?\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5954]\nas those provided in the Regular Walking Service, including Active Service management, Extend\nService, Replace Walker, and Cancel Service.\nUpgrade to Elite Service\nOverview\nPet parents can upgrade an existing Regular Walking Service to an Elite Walking Service before\na service provider has been assigned.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5946]\nWalk Durations\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\nSchedule Options\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n Active Service Tracking\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Notifications\n Secure Online Payment\nElite Walking Service (Premium)\nOverview\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): \r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: \r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Dog walking\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Dog walking', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\\n\\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\\n\\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\\n\\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\\n\\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\\n\\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\\n\\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 6\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"dog_walking\",\n    \"service_inquiry\",\n    \"petsfolio_app\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User inquired about dog walking services. Provided details on Regular and Elite walking options, eligibility, durations, frequencies, packages, and app download links.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 55,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Await user\'s next question or service interest\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'perplexity/sonar', 2917, '2026-07-17 12:12:02', '2026-07-17 12:12:02'),
(88, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5714]\nThe Petsfolio Walking Service is currently available in the following locations:\n Hyderabad, Telangana\n Mumbai, Maharashtra\n Bengaluru, Karnataka\n Tamil Nadu\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified service providers.\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nElite Walking Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\nWalking Frequencies\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\nWalk Durations\n 30 Minutes\n 60 Minutes\nElite Packages\n Paw Start (30 Days)\n Paw Prime (60 Days)\n Paw Elite (180 Days)\n Paw Royal (365 Days)\nSchedule Options\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5507]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5448]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5406]\n Stay\nOptional Add-On Training Modules\n Hug\n Balance Treat\n Kiss\n Jump\n Wave\n Cross Walk\n Hurdle Jump\n Socialization with Humans\n Leash Walk\n Excessive Barking\n Socialization with Pets\nBehaviour Training Package\nDuration: 20 Sessions\nPrice: 14999/-\nThe Behaviour Training package is designed to correct unwanted behaviours and improve the\npet\'s temperament.\nTraining Includes\n Begging\n Growling\n Hyper Active\n Jumping Control\n Leash Pulling\n Lunging\n Over Excitement\nOptional Add-On Training Modules\n Human Aggression\n Play Aggression\n Fear and Phobias\n Fear Aggression\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5405]\n Gentle\n Take\n Yes\n No / Leave It\n Jumping Control\n Socialization with Humans\n Sit/Stay\n Shake Hand\n Leash Walk\n Name Recognition\n Excessive Barking\n Socialization with Pets\n Crate Training\n Stand Stay\nIntermediate Training Package\nDuration: 15 Sessions\nPrice: 12999/-\nThe Intermediate Training package focuses on improving obedience and teaching advanced\ncommands.\nTraining Includes\n Biting Issues\n Come\n Don\'t Eat / Eat\n Down\n Hi-Fi\n Pee & Poo Training\n Play Dead\n Recall\n Roll Over\n Shake Hand\n Sit\n Sleep\n Speak\n Spin\n Stand\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.532]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.529]\n Chasing Other Dogs\n Canine Aggression\n Biting Issues\n Fear & Anxiety\n Separation Anxiety\n Excessive Barking\nAdvanced Training Package\nDuration: 30 Sessions\nPrice: 30000/-\nThe Advanced Training package provides comprehensive obedience and advanced skill\ndevelopment.\nTraining Includes\n Biting Issues\n Bring\n Come\n Crawl\n Don\'t Eat / Eat\n Down\n Fetch & Drop\n Focus Heel\n Hi-Fi\n Namaste\n Off-Leash Walk\n Pee & Poo Training\n Play Dead\n Recall\n Roll Over\n Salute\n Search / Find\n Shake Hand\n Sit\n Sleep\n Speak\n Spin\n Stand\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5276]\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nGrooming Service Summary\nSupported Pets\n Dog\n Cat\nGrooming Packages\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n Hair Trimming Package\nHair Trimming Styles\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\nOptional Add-On Services\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5271]\nUser Management\n User Registration\n OTP-Based Authentication\n Profile Management\n Account Settings\nPet Management\n Add Pet Profiles\n Edit Pet Information\n Manage Multiple Pets\n Store Pet Details\nPet Care Services\nUsers can book the following professional pet care services through the application:\n Dog Walking\n Grooming\n Pet Training\n Pet Sitting\n Veterinary Consultation\n Pet Insurance\nEach service provides its own booking workflow, availability, pricing, and assigned service\nprovider.\nBooking Management\nThe booking system allows users to:\n Select a service.\n Choose one or more pets.\n Select service location.\n Schedule preferred date and time.\n Review pricing details.\n Confirm bookings.\n Track booking progress.\n View active bookings.\n Access completed booking history.\n Download invoices where applicable.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5259]\n Complete booking and payment history.\n Reliable customer support.\n1.7 Scope of the Application\nThe Petsfolio Client Application manages the complete customer journey, from user\nregistration to successful service completion.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Hyderabad\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Hyderabad', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\\n\\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\\n\\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\\n\\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\\n\\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 7\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"dog_walking\",\n    \"hyderabad\",\n    \"service_available\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User confirmed interest in dog walking in Hyderabad. Service is available starting at ₹199/walk. User guided to download app for registration and booking.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 65,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Guide user to register pet and book via app\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'perplexity/sonar', 3348, '2026-07-17 12:13:57', '2026-07-17 12:13:57'),
(89, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5587]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5512]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5449]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5402]\nprocess.\nExample Response\nUser: How do I book a Training Service?\nAI Assistant:\nHello! Welcome to Petsfolio.\nTo book a Training Service, you\'ll first need the Petsfolio Client Application.\nDownload the app:\nAndroid (Google Play):\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store):\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAfter installing the app:\n Register using your mobile number.\n Complete OTP verification.\n Add your pet.\n Open Training Service.\n Follow the booking steps for the selected training package.\nIf the user already has the application installed, the AI Assistant should skip the download\ninstructions and directly explain the booking process.\nRegistration Process\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5372]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5341]\nIf a user asks how to book any service, the AI Assistant should first instruct them to download\nthe application (unless the user has already indicated that it is installed).\nPetsfolio Client Application Download Links\nAndroid (Google Play)\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store)\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAI Assistant Response Guidelines\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5338]\nThe application supports:\n User registration and authentication.\n Personal profile management.\n Pet profile management.\n Service discovery.\n Service booking.\n Booking scheduling.\n Secure payment processing.\n Wallet management.\n Booking tracking.\n Notifications and alerts.\n Booking history.\n Invoice management.\n Ratings and reviews.\n Loyalty rewards.\n Customer support.\nThe platform provides an end-to-end digital experience for pet parents to manage their pets\nand access professional pet care services efficiently.\n1.8 Business Value\nThe Petsfolio Client Application delivers significant business value by creating a centralized\ndigital ecosystem that connects pet parents with verified pet care professionals.\nThe platform improves customer convenience by offering multiple pet care services through a\nsingle application while increasing accessibility, transparency, and trust.\nKey business benefits include:\n Improved customer experience through centralized service management.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5324]\nThe Active Services module enables users to monitor and manage their ongoing training\nsessions.\nAvailable Information\nUsers can access:\n Current Booking Status\n Selected Training Package\n Selected Add-On Training Modules\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\n Service Address\n Pet Details\n Assigned Trainer Profile\n Booking Details\n Training Information\nThe booking remains available in the Active Services section until the training service is\ncompleted.\nCall Trainer\nThe Active Service page provides a Call option that allows users to contact the assigned trainer\ndirectly whenever required.\nCancel Service\nOverview\nThe Cancel Service feature allows users to cancel an upcoming or active Training Service\nwhenever required.\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5323]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5303]\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nService Availability\nThe Petsfolio Training Service is available for Dogs.\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified Petsfolio trainers.\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nTraining Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\nAI Agent: *Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\nCustomer: \n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: ', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\\n\\nOnce you download and register:\\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\\n\\n📲 **Download the app now**:\\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\\n\\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 7\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\"dog_walking\", \"hyderabad\", \"app_download\", \"booking_guide\"],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User confirmed interest in dog walking in Hyderabad; provided app download links and booking steps.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 75,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Await user to download app and register pet profile\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'perplexity/sonar', 3245, '2026-07-17 12:14:24', '2026-07-17 12:14:24');
