(90, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.588]\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient walking experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Regular Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nBooking Process\nThe Regular Walking Service booking process includes the following steps:\n1. Select the registered pet.\n2. Choose the Regular Walking Service.\n3. Select the walking frequency.\n4. Select the preferred walk duration.\n5. Choose the walking package.\n6. Select the preferred schedule.\n7. Choose the service start date.\n8. Select the preferred service time.\n9. Choose optional add-on services (if required).\n10. Submit the booking request.\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5761]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5668]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5548]\nWalk Duration\nEach walking session can be scheduled for:\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\nThe application offers multiple package durations:\nPackage 	Duration 	Price\nExpress Package 	3 Days 	195/walk\nShort-Term Package 	7 Days 	146/walk\nMid-Term Package 	15 Days 	125/walk\nLong-Term Package 	30 Days 	96/walk\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5476]\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nComplimentary Add-Ons\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nOptional Paid Add-On\n Poo Picking\nPremium Benefits\n Certified & Verified Service Providers\n Priority Matching\n 24/7 Customer Support\n Complimentary Add-Ons\n Premium Service Experience\nBooking Status Flow\n1. Payment Completed\n2. Service Provider Not Assigned\n3. Service Provider Assigned\n4. Active Jobs\n5. Service Completion\nRelated Features\n Upgrade to Elite\n Active Jobs\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Tracking\n Secure Online Payment\n Customer Support\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5463]\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5427]\nas those provided in the Regular Walking Service, including Active Service management, Extend\nService, Replace Walker, and Cancel Service.\nUpgrade to Elite Service\nOverview\nPet parents can upgrade an existing Regular Walking Service to an Elite Walking Service before\na service provider has been assigned.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5421]\napplication.\nCoverage Options\nPetsfolio offers the following insurance coverage options:\nBasic\n Accidents Only\nStandard\n Accidents + Illness\nPremium\n Standard Coverage\n Wellness Benefits\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.542]\n6. Can I book walking services for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book walking services for multiple registered pets.\n7. How do I book a Walking Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose Regular or Elite Walking Service, select the frequency,\nduration, package, schedule, preferred start date, preferred time, optional add-ons, and\ncomplete the booking process.\n8. What walking frequencies are available?\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n9. What walk durations are available?\n 30 Minutes\n 60 Minutes\n10. What packages are available in the Regular Walking\nService?\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5396]\nUsers can navigate to the Profile section and add, edit, or manage their pets at any time.\n2. During Service Booking\nIf a user has not previously registered a pet, the application provides an option to add a new\npet during the service booking process before proceeding with the booking.\nPet Management\nAfter a pet is successfully added:\n The pet profile is linked to the user\'s account.\n The pet is saved for future use.\n Multiple pets can be registered under the same account.\n Existing pet information can be updated whenever required.\n Registered pets can be selected directly while booking any supported pet care service.\nBenefits\nThe Add Pet feature provides the following benefits:\n Centralized pet profile management.\n Faster service booking.\n Reduced need to enter pet information repeatedly.\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\nAI Agent: *Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\nCustomer: \nAI Agent: *Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\n\nOnce you download and register:\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\n\n📲 **Download the app now**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Regular\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\n\nOnce you download and register:\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\n\n📲 **Download the app now**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Regular\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Regular', '{\n  \"reply\": \"Great choice! The *Regular Walking Service* is designed to meet your dog\'s daily exercise needs. Here\'s what you can expect:\\n\\n*   **Duration:** Choose between 30-minute or 60-minute walks.\\n*   **Frequency:** Select from Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day.\\n*   **Packages:** We offer Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), and Long-Term (30 Days) packages.\\n*   **Add-ons:** You can opt for Poo Picking and Paw Cleaning.\\n\\nRemember, your dog needs to be registered in the *Petsfolio Client App* before you can book this service. You can also book for multiple registered pets under one account.\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"Regular Walking Service\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User selected Regular Walking Service for their dog in Hyderabad.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Provide app download links and booking instructions.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 3668, '2026-07-17 12:15:15', '2026-07-17 12:15:15'),
(91, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.6239]\nWalk Duration\nEach walking session can be scheduled for:\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\nThe application offers multiple package durations:\nPackage 	Duration 	Price\nExpress Package 	3 Days 	195/walk\nShort-Term Package 	7 Days 	146/walk\nMid-Term Package 	15 Days 	125/walk\nLong-Term Package 	30 Days 	96/walk\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.6142]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.6121]\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nComplimentary Add-Ons\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nOptional Paid Add-On\n Poo Picking\nPremium Benefits\n Certified & Verified Service Providers\n Priority Matching\n 24/7 Customer Support\n Complimentary Add-Ons\n Premium Service Experience\nBooking Status Flow\n1. Payment Completed\n2. Service Provider Not Assigned\n3. Service Provider Assigned\n4. Active Jobs\n5. Service Completion\nRelated Features\n Upgrade to Elite\n Active Jobs\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Tracking\n Secure Online Payment\n Customer Support\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.609]\nWalk Durations\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\nSchedule Options\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n Active Service Tracking\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Notifications\n Secure Online Payment\nElite Walking Service (Premium)\nOverview\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.6071]\nAbout Sitting Service\nThe Petsfolio Sitting Service connects pet parents with verified and experienced pet sitters\nthrough the Petsfolio Client Application. The service is designed to provide professional care for\npets when their owners are away, ensuring they receive proper attention, feeding,\ncompanionship, medication (if required), and routine care in a safe and comfortable\nenvironment.\nBefore booking a Sitting Service, users must download the Petsfolio Client Application, register\ntheir account, complete OTP verification, and add at least one pet profile.\nThe Sitting Service is available for both Dogs and Cats.\nTo book a Sitting Service, users select their pet, choose the preferred sitting package, select the\nstay duration by choosing the From Date and To Date, select the Preferred Time Slot, confirm\nthe service address, and submit the booking request.\nSitting Service Packages\nPetsfolio offers the following Sitting Service packages:\nOvernight Care – 1499/-\n 24 Hours\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.6036]\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient walking experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Regular Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nBooking Process\nThe Regular Walking Service booking process includes the following steps:\n1. Select the registered pet.\n2. Choose the Regular Walking Service.\n3. Select the walking frequency.\n4. Select the preferred walk duration.\n5. Choose the walking package.\n6. Select the preferred schedule.\n7. Choose the service start date.\n8. Select the preferred service time.\n9. Choose optional add-on services (if required).\n10. Submit the booking request.\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.6011]\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5996]\n To Date\n Preferred Time Slot\n Service Address\n Pet Details\n Assigned Service Provider Details\nA Call option is available to contact the assigned service provider directly.\nPet Care Tasks\nDuring the Sitting Service, the assigned service provider can manage the pet\'s daily care using\npredefined tasks.\nAvailable task categories include:\n Feeding\n Medication\n Walk\nThese tasks are optional and are provided at no additional cost.\nPet parents can add tasks only before the Sitting Service begins. Once the service has started,\nnew tasks cannot be added.\nDuring the service, the assigned sitter updates the completion status of each task.\nPet parents receive notifications and can review each completed task by choosing to:\n Approve\n Reject\nExtend Sitting Service\nPet parents can extend an ongoing Sitting Service without creating a new booking.\nTo request an extension, users select the preferred package and submit the extension request\nto the assigned service provider.\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5974]\n6. Can I book walking services for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book walking services for multiple registered pets.\n7. How do I book a Walking Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose Regular or Elite Walking Service, select the frequency,\nduration, package, schedule, preferred start date, preferred time, optional add-ons, and\ncomplete the booking process.\n8. What walking frequencies are available?\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n9. What walk durations are available?\n 30 Minutes\n 60 Minutes\n10. What packages are available in the Regular Walking\nService?\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5952]\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nAdd-On Services\nComplimentary Add-Ons\nThe following services are included with every Elite package at no additional cost:\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nOptional Paid Add-On\nThe following add-on can be selected during booking:\n Poo Picking\nBooking Status\nService Provider Not Assigned\nImmediately after successful payment:\n The booking is created successfully.\n The booking appears under the Bookings section.\n The initial booking status is displayed as Service Provider Not Assigned.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: h