 them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: 30 mins\n3 days\n2 pets', '```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Got it! You\'ve selected the *Regular Walking Service* for your 2 dogs, with 30-minute walks under the Express Package (3 Days).\\n\\nThis package includes:\\n*   **Walk Duration:** 30 Minutes\\n*   **Package:** Express Package (3 Days)\\n*   **Number of Pets:** 2\\n\\nTo finalize your booking, please download the Petsfolio Client App, register your pets, and complete the process there. You can also add optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning during booking.\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"Regular Walking Service\",\n    \"Express Package\",\n    \"30-Minute Walk\",\n    \"Multiple Pets\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User selected Regular Walking Service for 2 dogs, 30-minute duration, and Express Package (3 Days).\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Direct user to the app for booking.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n```', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 4131, '2026-07-17 12:15:52', '2026-07-17 12:15:52'),
(92, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5483]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5467]\nYes. Users can choose their preferred time slot while booking the service.\nCan I receive quotations from multiple service providers?\nYes. Eligible service providers can submit quotations, allowing users to compare pricing and\nprovider details before confirming the booking.\nCan I chat with the service provider before booking?\nYes. Users can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nthe booking.\nCan I view the service provider\'s profile before booking?\nYes. Users can view service provider profiles, customer ratings, reviews, previous service\nphotos, and quotation details before selecting a sitter.\nWhere can I view my confirmed booking?\nConfirmed bookings appear in the Active Services section of the Petsfolio Client Application.\nWhat information is available in Active Sitting Service?\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5401]\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\nCan I contact my assigned sitter?\nYes. A Call option is available within the booking details.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5344]\nYes. The application provides a Call option within the booking details.\n23. Can I cancel my Grooming Service?\nYes. Grooming Services can be cancelled according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\n24. What does \"Not Started\" mean?\nIt indicates that the assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\n25. What does \"In Progress\" mean?\nIt indicates that the grooming session has started.\n26. Can I approve the Grooming Service?\nYes. Once the service has started, you can approve the service if you are satisfied.\n27. Can I reject the Grooming Service?\nYes. If you are not satisfied with the service, you can reject it through the application.\n28. What is the Terminate Service option?\nThe Terminate Service option allows you to stop an ongoing grooming session before\ncompletion.\n29. Can I book Grooming Service for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book Grooming Services for multiple registered pets.\n30. Where is the Petsfolio Grooming Service available?\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5311]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5309]\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n21. Can I view my assigned service provider\'s details?\nYes. You can view the assigned service provider\'s profile and booking details.\n22. Can I contact the assigned service provider?\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5254]\nNo. Add-on services are optional and charged separately.\n14. Can I book Grooming Service without add-ons?\nYes.\n15. What happens after I submit my Grooming Service request?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n16. Can I compare multiple quotations?\nYes. The application allows you to compare quotations before selecting a service provider.\n17. Can I chat with service providers before confirming my booking?\nYes. You can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nyour booking.\n18. What information is available in a quotation?\nA quotation includes:\n Service Cost\n Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Grooming Service Photos\n Other provider details\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5249]\n Blowing\n Combing\n7. What is included in the Anti-Tick Bath Package?\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\n8. What Hair Trimming styles are available?\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\n9. Can I choose multiple Hair Trimming styles?\nNo. Only one Hair Trimming style can be selected for each booking.\n10. Can I choose my preferred service date?\nYes.\n11. Can I choose my preferred service time?\nYes.\n12. What add-on services are available?\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\n13. Are add-on services included in the grooming package?\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5229]\nCombing.\n4. Which pets are eligible for the Walking Service?\nCurrently, Walking Service is available only for registered Dogs.\n5. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a walking service.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5223]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\nAI Agent: *Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\nCustomer: \nAI Agent: *Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\n\nOnce you download and register:\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\n\n📲 **Download the app now**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Regular\nAI Agent: Great choice! The *Regular Walking Service* is designed to meet your dog\'s daily exercise needs. Here\'s what you can expect:\n\n*   **Duration:** Choose between 30-minute or 60-minute walks.\n*   **Frequency:** Select from Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day.\n*   **Packages:** We offer Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), and Long-Term (30 Days) packages.\n*   **Add-ons:** You can opt for Poo Picking and Paw Cleaning.\n\nRemember, your dog needs to be registered in the *Petsfolio Client App* before you can book this service. You can also book for multiple registered pets under one account.\nCustomer: 30 mins\n3 days\n2 pets\nAI Agent: Got it! You\'ve selected the *Regular Walking Service* for your 2 dogs, with 30-minute walks under the Express Package (3 Days).\n\nThis package includes:\n*   **Walk Duration:** 30 Minutes\n*   **Package:** Express Package (3 Days)\n*   **Number of Pets:** 2\n\nTo finalize your booking, please download the Petsfolio Client App, register your pets, and complete the process there. You can also add optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning during booking.\nCustomer: Yes\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"Got it! You\'ve selected the *Regular Walking Service* for your 2 dogs, with 30-minute walks under the Express Package (3 Days).\n\nThis package includes:\n*   **Walk Duration:** 30 Minutes\n*   **Package:** Express Package (3 Days)\n*   **Number of Pets:** 2\n\nTo finalize your booking, please download the Petsfolio Client App, register your pets, and complete the process there. You can also add optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning during booking.\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Yes\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Yes', '```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Great! Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed. You can finalize this in the Petsfolio Client App. Don\'t forget to add any optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning there!\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"Dog walking\",\n    \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"Regular Walking Service\",\n    \"Express Package\",\n    \"2 pets\",\n    \"30 mins\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User confirmed booking details for 2 dogs, 30-minute walks, 3-day Express Package for dog walking in Hyderabad.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 90,\n  \"nextAction\": \"User has confirmed booking details and is directed to the app to finalize.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n```', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 3825, '2026-07-17 12:16:23', '2026-07-17 12:16:23');
