(93, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.578]\nNo. Add-on services are optional and charged separately.\n14. Can I book Grooming Service without add-ons?\nYes.\n15. What happens after I submit my Grooming Service request?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n16. Can I compare multiple quotations?\nYes. The application allows you to compare quotations before selecting a service provider.\n17. Can I chat with service providers before confirming my booking?\nYes. You can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nyour booking.\n18. What information is available in a quotation?\nA quotation includes:\n Service Cost\n Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Grooming Service Photos\n Other provider details\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5619]\nThe following are complimentary with every Elite package:\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\n17. Is Poo Picking included in the Elite package?\nNo. Poo Picking is available as an optional paid add-on.\n18. Can I select add-ons while booking?\nYes. Add-ons can be selected during the booking process.\n19. Can I modify add-ons after booking?\nAdd-on modifications depend on the booking status and service provider approval.\n20. What happens after I submit a Regular Walking Service\nrequest?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n21. How are service providers selected for Regular Walking\nService?\nNearby verified service providers receive your request and submit quotations. You can compare\nthem before confirming your booking.\n22. What information is available in a quotation?\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5615]\n Blowing\n Combing\n7. What is included in the Anti-Tick Bath Package?\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\n8. What Hair Trimming styles are available?\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\n9. Can I choose multiple Hair Trimming styles?\nNo. Only one Hair Trimming style can be selected for each booking.\n10. Can I choose my preferred service date?\nYes.\n11. Can I choose my preferred service time?\nYes.\n12. What add-on services are available?\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\n13. Are add-on services included in the grooming package?\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.559]\n Combing\nThese add-ons provide additional care during the walking session and can be selected based on\nthe pet parent\'s preferences.\nService Provider Quotation\nOverview\nAfter a walking service request is submitted, the Petsfolio platform automatically shares the\nrequest with nearby eligible and available service providers based on the selected service\nlocation.\nInterested service providers can review the booking request and submit their quotations\nthrough the application.\nQuotation Information\nEach quotation includes information that helps pet parents compare available service\nproviders, including:\n Service Cost\n Service Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Completed Service History\n Verification Status\n Relevant Provider Information\nSelecting a Service Provider\nPet parents can review and compare all received quotations before confirming the booking.\nThe application allows users to compare:\n Pricing\n Ratings\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5552]\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nAdd-On Services\nComplimentary Add-Ons\nThe following services are included with every Elite package at no additional cost:\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nOptional Paid Add-On\nThe following add-on can be selected during booking:\n Poo Picking\nBooking Status\nService Provider Not Assigned\nImmediately after successful payment:\n The booking is created successfully.\n The booking appears under the Bookings section.\n The initial booking status is displayed as Service Provider Not Assigned.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5536]\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nGrooming Service Summary\nSupported Pets\n Dog\n Cat\nGrooming Packages\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n Hair Trimming Package\nHair Trimming Styles\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\nOptional Add-On Services\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.551]\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nComplimentary Add-Ons\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nOptional Paid Add-On\n Poo Picking\nPremium Benefits\n Certified & Verified Service Providers\n Priority Matching\n 24/7 Customer Support\n Complimentary Add-Ons\n Premium Service Experience\nBooking Status Flow\n1. Payment Completed\n2. Service Provider Not Assigned\n3. Service Provider Assigned\n4. Active Jobs\n5. Service Completion\nRelated Features\n Upgrade to Elite\n Active Jobs\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Tracking\n Secure Online Payment\n Customer Support\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5471]\n Full Trim - 900/-\n Stylish Trim – 1499/-\nOnly one trimming style can be selected for each booking.\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nThese add-ons provide additional care during the grooming session and can be selected based\non the pet parent\'s preferences.\nService Provider Quotation\nOverview\nAfter a Grooming Service request is submitted, the Petsfolio platform automatically shares the\nrequest with nearby eligible and available service providers based on the selected service\nlocation.\nInterested service providers can review the booking request and submit their quotations\nthrough the application.\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5406]\n Stay\nOptional Add-On Training Modules\n Counting (1 to 5)\n Close Door\n Open Door\n Walk Backwards\n Clean Up\n Walk Between the Legs\n Guard\n Lie Down\n Watch\nService Provider Quotation\nOverview\nAfter a Training Service request is submitted, the Petsfolio platform automatically shares the\nrequest with nearby eligible and available trainers based on the selected service location.\nInterested trainers can review the booking request and submit their quotations through the\napplication.\nQuotation Information\nEach quotation includes information that helps pet parents compare available trainers,\nincluding:\n Training Cost\n Trainer Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Training Experience\n Relevant Trainer Information\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5388]\nWalk Duration\nEach walking session can be scheduled for:\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\nThe application offers multiple package durations:\nPackage 	Duration 	Price\nExpress Package 	3 Days 	195/walk\nShort-Term Package 	7 Days 	146/walk\nMid-Term Package 	15 Days 	125/walk\nLong-Term Package 	30 Days 	96/walk\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\nAI Agent: *Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\nCustomer: \nAI Agent: *Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\n\nOnce you download and register:\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\n\n📲 **Download the app now**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Regular\nAI Agent: Great choice! The *Regular Walking Service* is designed to meet your dog\'s daily exercise needs. Here\'s what you can expect:\n\n*   **Duration:** Choose between 30-minute or 60-minute walks.\n*   **Frequency:** Select from Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day.\n*   **Packages:** We offer Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), and Long-Term (30 Days) packages.\n*   **Add-ons:** You can opt for Poo Picking and Paw Cleaning.\n\nRemember, your dog needs to be registered in the *Petsfolio Client App* before you can book this service. You can also book for multiple registered pets under one account.\nCustomer: 30 mins\n3 days\n2 pets\nAI Agent: Got it! You\'ve selected the *Regular Walking Service* for your 2 dogs, with 30-minute walks under the Express Package (3 Days).\n\nThis package includes:\n*   **Walk Duration:** 30 Minutes\n*   **Package:** Express Package (3 Days)\n*   **Number of Pets:** 2\n\nTo finalize your booking, please download the Petsfolio Client App, register your pets, and complete the process there. You can also add optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning during booking.\nCustomer: Yes\nAI Agent: Great! Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed. You can finalize this in the Petsfolio Client App. Don\'t forget to add any optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning there!\nCustomer: No ,add ons\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"Great! Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed. You can finalize this in the Petsfolio Client App. Don\'t forget to add any optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning there!\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"No ,add ons\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: No ,add ons', '```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Understood! You\'ve opted out of add-ons for your dog walking service. Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed and ready to be finalized in the Petsfolio Client App.\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User confirmed booking for 2 dogs, 30-minute walks, 3 days, regular service, and opted out of add-ons.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Direct user to finalize booking in the app.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n```', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 4273, '2026-07-17 12:17:04', '2026-07-17 12:17:04'),
(94, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5423]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5385]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5315]\nprocess.\nExample Response\nUser: How do I book a Training Service?\nAI Assistant:\nHello! Welcome to Petsfolio.\nTo book a Training Service, you\'ll first need the Petsfolio Client Application.\nDownload the app:\nAndroid (Google Play):\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store):\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAfter installing the app:\n Register using your mobile number.\n Complete OTP verification.\n Add your pet.\n Open Training Service.\n Follow the booking steps for the selected training package.\nIf the user already has the application installed, the AI Assistant should skip the download\ninstructions and directly explain the booking process.\nRegistration Process\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5306]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5299]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5273]\nPayments\nThe application supports secure online payments and allows users to:\n Make payments during booking.\n View payment history.\n Check payment status.\n Access booking invoices.\nWallet Management\nThe integrated wallet enables users to:\n View wallet balance.\n Add funds.\n Use wallet balance for bookings.\n View wallet transaction history.\n Track credits and debits.\nNotifications\nUsers receive notifications for:\n Booking confirmation.\n Service provider assignment.\n Booking status updates.\n Payment confirmation.\n Booking cancellation.\n Promotional offers.\n Loyalty rewards.\n Important announcements.\nRatings and Reviews\nAfter service completion, users can:\n Rate service providers.\n Submit reviews.\n Share service experiences.\nRatings and reviews help maintain service quality and improve transparency across the\nplatform.\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5271]\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nService Availability\nThe Petsfolio Training Service is available for Dogs.\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified Petsfolio trainers.\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nTraining Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5266]\nOverview\nThe Cancel Service feature allows users to cancel an upcoming or active walking service\nwhenever required.\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nWalking Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\nWalking Frequencies\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.525]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5249]\nIf a user asks how to book any service, the AI Assistant should first instruct them to download\nthe application (unless the user has already indicated that it is installed).\nPetsfolio Client Application Download Links\nAndroid (Google Play)\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store)\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAI Assistant Response Guidelines\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and complimentary pet care add-ons\n- Provided by **Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers**\n\n✅ You must **register your dog** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n✅ You can book for **multiple registered pets** under one account.\n\n📲 **To book:** Download the Petsfolio app, register, add your pet profile, and choose your walking service:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details on grooming, boarding, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Hyderabad\nAI Agent: *Great!* Dog walking is now available in **Hyderabad** at Petsfolio 🐾\n\nOur trusted dog walkers in Hyderabad start at **₹199 per walk**, with rates varying by time and area[1][5]. You can choose from:\n- **30 mins** or **60 mins** walk durations\n- **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day** frequencies\n- Packages: Express (3 Days) to Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n✅ Your dog must be **registered** in the *Petsfolio Client App* before booking.\n\n📲 **Download the app to book**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nTrack your pet’s walk route, distance, and get instant notifications—all from the app[5][9]. Let me know if you’d like details on grooming, training, or other services! 😊\nCustomer: \nAI Agent: *Perfect!* Your dog walking service in **Hyderabad** is all set to book via the **Petsfolio Client App** 🐾\n\nOnce you download and register:\n- Add your **dog’s profile**\n- Choose between **Regular** (₹199/start) or **Elite** walking packages\n- Select duration (30/60 mins), frequency, and add-ons like *Poo Picking* or *Paw Cleaning*\n- Track your pet’s walk route and get instant notifications 📲\n\n📲 **Download the app now**:\n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nLet me know if you’d like help with grooming, training, or any other service! 😊\nCustomer: Regular\nAI Agent: Great choice! The *Regular Walking Service* is designed to meet your dog\'s daily exercise needs. Here\'s what you can expect:\n\n*   **Duration:** Choose between 30-minute or 60-minute walks.\n*   **Frequency:** Select from Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day.\n*   **Packages:** We offer Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), and Long-Term (30 Days) packages.\n*   **Add-ons:** You can opt for Poo Picking and Paw Cleaning.\n\nRemember, your dog needs to be registered in the *Petsfolio Client App* before you can book this service. You can also book for multiple registered pets under one account.\nCustomer: 30 mins\n3 days\n2 pets\nAI Agent: Got it! You\'ve selected the *Regular Walking Service* for your 2 dogs, with 30-minute walks under the Express Package (3 Days).\n\nThis package includes:\n*   **Walk Duration:** 30 Minutes\n*   **Package:** Express Package (3 Days)\n*   **Number of Pets:** 2\n\nTo finalize your booking, please download the Petsfolio Client App, register your pets, and complete the process there. You can also add optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning during booking.\nCustomer: Yes\nAI Agent: Great! Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed. You can finalize this in the Petsfolio Client App. Don\'t forget to add any optional services like Poo Picking or Paw Cleaning there!\nCustomer: No ,add ons\nAI Agent: Understood! You\'ve opted out of add-ons for your dog walking service. Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed and ready to be finalized in the Petsfolio Client App.\nCustomer: Ok\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"Understood! You\'ve opted out of add-ons for your dog walking service. Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days is confirmed and ready to be finalized in the Petsfolio Client App.\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Ok\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Abhi will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Ok', '```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Great! Your booking for 2 dogs with 30-minute walks for 3 days, without add-ons, is confirmed and ready to be finalized in the Petsfolio Client App. Let me know if you need anything else!\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"Hyderabad\",\n    \"intent\": \"Dog walking\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User confirmed booking for 2 dogs, 30-minute walks, 3 days, no add-ons. Ready to finalize in app.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 90,\n  \"nextAction\": \"User confirmed booking details and is ready to finalize in the app.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n```', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 3859, '2026-07-17 12:17:33', '2026-07-17 12:17:33'),
(95, 23, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5287]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5171]\nNo. Add-on services are optional and charged separately.\n14. Can I book Grooming Service without add-ons?\nYes.\n15. What happens after I submit my Grooming Service request?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n16. Can I compare multiple quotations?\nYes. The application allows you to compare quotations before selecting a service provider.\n17. Can I chat with service providers before confirming my booking?\nYes. You can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nyour booking.\n18. What information is available in a quotation?\nA quotation includes:\n Service Cost\n Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Grooming Service Photos\n Other provider details\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5143]\nCombing.\n4. Which pets are eligible for the Walking Service?\nCurrently, Walking Service is available only for registered Dogs.\n5. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a walking service.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5135]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5102]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5102]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5098]\nNot Started\nThe assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\nIn Progress\nThe assigned service provider has started the grooming session.\nApprove Service\nOnce the grooming session has started, pet parents can approve the service if they are satisfied\nwith the service being provided.\nReject Service\nIf the pet parent is not satisfied with the grooming service, they can reject the service through\nthe application and raise their concern.\nTerminate Service\nThe Terminate Service feature allows pet parents to stop an ongoing grooming service before\ncompletion whenever required.\nService Availability\nThe Petsfolio Grooming Service is available for Dogs and Cats.\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified service providers.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5065]\nYes. The application provides a Call option within the booking details.\n23. Can I cancel my Grooming Service?\nYes. Grooming Services can be cancelled according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\n24. What does \"Not Started\" mean?\nIt indicates that the assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\n25. What does \"In Progress\" mean?\nIt indicates that the grooming session has started.\n26. Can I approve the Grooming Service?\nYes. Once the service has started, you can approve the service if you are satisfied.\n27. Can I reject the Grooming Service?\nYes. If you are not satisfied with the service, you can reject it through the application.\n28. What is the Terminate Service option?\nThe Terminate Service option allows you to stop an ongoing grooming session before\ncompletion.\n29. Can I book Grooming Service for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book Grooming Services for multiple registered pets.\n30. Where is the Petsfolio Grooming Service available?\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5054]\n Blowing\n Combing\n7. What is included in the Anti-Tick Bath Package?\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\n8. What Hair Trimming styles are available?\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\n9. Can I choose multiple Hair Trimming styles?\nNo. Only one Hair Trimming style can be selected for each booking.\n10. Can I choose my preferred service date?\nYes.\n11. Can I choose my preferred service time?\nYes.\n12. What add-on services are available?\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\n13. Are add-on services included in the grooming package?\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.501]\nIf a user asks how to book any service, the AI Assistant should first instruct them to download\nthe application (unless the user has already indicated that it is installed).\nPetsfolio Client Application Download Links\nAndroid (Google Play)\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store)\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAI Assistant Response Guidelines\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: Petsfolio | Phone: 918897727709 | Rep: Abhi\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Dog walking\r\n- City: Hyderabad\r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hlo\nCustomer: Hlo\nAI Agent: *Hello!* Welcome to **Petsfolio**! 🐾\n\nI\'m your AI assistant here to help you with all your pet care needs. Whether you\'re looking for **dog walking**, **grooming**, **pet sitting**, **training**, **boarding**, or even **pet insurance**, we have verified professionals ready to assist.\n\nTo book any service, you\'ll need the **Petsfolio Client Application**:\n\n📲 **Download the app:**  \n- Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en  \n- iOS: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\n\nOnce installed, just **register**, complete **OTP verification**, add your **pet profile**, and choose the service you\'d like to book!\n\nLet me know if you\'d like details about a specific service. 😊\nCustomer: Dog walking\nAI Agent: *Dog Walking Service at Petsfolio* 🐾\n\nWe offer two types of dog walking services:\n\n1️⃣ **Regular Walking Service**\n- Available for **registered dogs** only\n- Walk durations: **30 mins** or **60 mins**\n- Frequencies: **Once, Twice, or Thrice a Day**\n- Packages: Express (3 Days), Short-Term (7 Days), Mid-Term (15 Days), Long-Term (30 Days)\n- Add-ons: Poo Picking, Paw Cleaning\n\n2️⃣ **Elite Walking Service** (Premium)\n- Includes **24/7 support**, priority matching, and