(99, 24, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5483]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5467]\nYes. Users can choose their preferred time slot while booking the service.\nCan I receive quotations from multiple service providers?\nYes. Eligible service providers can submit quotations, allowing users to compare pricing and\nprovider details before confirming the booking.\nCan I chat with the service provider before booking?\nYes. Users can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nthe booking.\nCan I view the service provider\'s profile before booking?\nYes. Users can view service provider profiles, customer ratings, reviews, previous service\nphotos, and quotation details before selecting a sitter.\nWhere can I view my confirmed booking?\nConfirmed bookings appear in the Active Services section of the Petsfolio Client Application.\nWhat information is available in Active Sitting Service?\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5401]\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\nCan I contact my assigned sitter?\nYes. A Call option is available within the booking details.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5344]\nYes. The application provides a Call option within the booking details.\n23. Can I cancel my Grooming Service?\nYes. Grooming Services can be cancelled according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\n24. What does \"Not Started\" mean?\nIt indicates that the assigned service provider has not yet started the grooming session.\n25. What does \"In Progress\" mean?\nIt indicates that the grooming session has started.\n26. Can I approve the Grooming Service?\nYes. Once the service has started, you can approve the service if you are satisfied.\n27. Can I reject the Grooming Service?\nYes. If you are not satisfied with the service, you can reject it through the application.\n28. What is the Terminate Service option?\nThe Terminate Service option allows you to stop an ongoing grooming session before\ncompletion.\n29. Can I book Grooming Service for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book Grooming Services for multiple registered pets.\n30. Where is the Petsfolio Grooming Service available?\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5311]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5309]\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n21. Can I view my assigned service provider\'s details?\nYes. You can view the assigned service provider\'s profile and booking details.\n22. Can I contact the assigned service provider?\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5254]\nNo. Add-on services are optional and charged separately.\n14. Can I book Grooming Service without add-ons?\nYes.\n15. What happens after I submit my Grooming Service request?\nThe request is shared with nearby eligible service providers who can submit quotations.\n16. Can I compare multiple quotations?\nYes. The application allows you to compare quotations before selecting a service provider.\n17. Can I chat with service providers before confirming my booking?\nYes. You can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nyour booking.\n18. What information is available in a quotation?\nA quotation includes:\n Service Cost\n Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Customer Reviews\n Previous Grooming Service Photos\n Other provider details\n19. How do I confirm my booking?\nSelect your preferred quotation and complete the payment.\n20. Where can I view my confirmed booking?\nYour confirmed booking appears under the Active Services section.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5249]\n Blowing\n Combing\n7. What is included in the Anti-Tick Bath Package?\n Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n Anti-Flea Treatment\n Anti-Tick Treatment\n8. What Hair Trimming styles are available?\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\n9. Can I choose multiple Hair Trimming styles?\nNo. Only one Hair Trimming style can be selected for each booking.\n10. Can I choose my preferred service date?\nYes.\n11. Can I choose my preferred service time?\nYes.\n12. What add-on services are available?\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\n13. Are add-on services included in the grooming package?\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5229]\nCombing.\n4. Which pets are eligible for the Walking Service?\nCurrently, Walking Service is available only for registered Dogs.\n5. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a walking service.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5223]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: 😊 | Phone: 918329526679 | Rep: vijay\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Missing\r\n- City: Missing\r\n- Pet Type: Missing\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Yes\nCustomer: Yes\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"(none — this is the first message to this lead)\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Yes\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that vijay will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Yes', '{\n  \"reply\": \"Hello! Welcome to Petsfolio. I\'m here to help you with any questions you might have about our services. What can I assist you with today?\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": null,\n    \"breed\": null,\n    \"petAge\": null,\n    \"city\": null,\n    \"intent\": null,\n    \"specialRequirements\": null,\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User initiated conversation. Agent greeted the user and asked how they can assist.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Ask user about their query.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": null,\n    \"followUpDate\": null,\n    \"addNote\": null\n  }\n}', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 2353, '2026-07-17 12:22:45', '2026-07-17 12:22:45'),
(100, 25, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5587]\nRegistration Outcome\nAfter successful registration:\n The user account is created.\nField 	Required Description\nFull Name 	Yes 	Name of the pet parent.\nEmail Address Optional Used for communication and account-related notifications.\nProfile Photo 	Optional Personal profile image displayed within the application.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5512]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5449]\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5402]\nprocess.\nExample Response\nUser: How do I book a Training Service?\nAI Assistant:\nHello! Welcome to Petsfolio.\nTo book a Training Service, you\'ll first need the Petsfolio Client Application.\nDownload the app:\nAndroid (Google Play):\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store):\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAfter installing the app:\n Register using your mobile number.\n Complete OTP verification.\n Add your pet.\n Open Training Service.\n Follow the booking steps for the selected training package.\nIf the user already has the application installed, the AI Assistant should skip the download\ninstructions and directly explain the booking process.\nRegistration Process\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5372]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5341]\nIf a user asks how to book any service, the AI Assistant should first instruct them to download\nthe application (unless the user has already indicated that it is installed).\nPetsfolio Client Application Download Links\nAndroid (Google Play)\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.petsfolio.customer&hl=en\niOS (App Store)\nhttps://apps.apple.com/in/app/petsfolio-pet-parent/id6746559723\nAI Assistant Response Guidelines\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5338]\nThe application supports:\n User registration and authentication.\n Personal profile management.\n Pet profile management.\n Service discovery.\n Service booking.\n Booking scheduling.\n Secure payment processing.\n Wallet management.\n Booking tracking.\n Notifications and alerts.\n Booking history.\n Invoice management.\n Ratings and reviews.\n Loyalty rewards.\n Customer support.\nThe platform provides an end-to-end digital experience for pet parents to manage their pets\nand access professional pet care services efficiently.\n1.8 Business Value\nThe Petsfolio Client Application delivers significant business value by creating a centralized\ndigital ecosystem that connects pet parents with verified pet care professionals.\nThe platform improves customer convenience by offering multiple pet care services through a\nsingle application while increasing accessibility, transparency, and trust.\nKey business benefits include:\n Improved customer experience through centralized service management.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5324]\nThe Active Services module enables users to monitor and manage their ongoing training\nsessions.\nAvailable Information\nUsers can access:\n Current Booking Status\n Selected Training Package\n Selected Add-On Training Modules\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\n Service Address\n Pet Details\n Assigned Trainer Profile\n Booking Details\n Training Information\nThe booking remains available in the Active Services section until the training service is\ncompleted.\nCall Trainer\nThe Active Service page provides a Call option that allows users to contact the assigned trainer\ndirectly whenever required.\nCancel Service\nOverview\nThe Cancel Service feature allows users to cancel an upcoming or active Training Service\nwhenever required.\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5323]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5303]\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nService Availability\nThe Petsfolio Training Service is available for Dogs.\nService availability depends on:\n Selected service location.\n Availability of verified Petsfolio trainers.\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nTraining Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: WhatsApp Contact | Phone: 919355089479 | Rep: ram\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Missing\r\n- City: Missing\r\n- Pet Type: Missing\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: \nCustomer: \n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"(none — this is the first message to this lead)\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that ram will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: ', '{\n  \"reply\": \"Hello! Welcome to Petsfolio. I can help you with information about our services. What would you like to know about?\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User initiated conversation, asking for information about services.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFol