(105, 26, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.5697]\nadditional care services.\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient grooming experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Grooming Service is currently available for Dogs and Cats registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5676]\n Active Service Tracking\n Call Service Provider\n Cancel Service\n Approve Service\n Reject Service\n Terminate Service\n Booking Notifications\n Secure Online Payment\nPetsfolio Grooming Service – Frequently Asked\nQuestions (FAQs)\n1. What is the Petsfolio Grooming Service?\nPetsfolio Grooming Service provides professional grooming for Dogs and Cats to maintain their\nhygiene, health, and appearance.\n2. Which pets are eligible for the Grooming Service?\nCurrently, Grooming Service is available only for registered Dogs and Cats.\n3. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a Grooming Service.\n4. How do I book a Grooming Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose a grooming package, select the preferred service date and\ntime, choose optional add-on services if required, confirm the service address, and submit the\nbooking request.\n5. What grooming packages are available?\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5673]\nPetsfolio Client Application\n1. Introduction\n1.1 Overview\nThe Petsfolio Client Application is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and\nenhance pet care management for pet parents. It provides a secure, user-friendly, and\ncentralized digital ecosystem where users can manage their pets and access a wide range of\nprofessional pet care services from a single application.\nThrough the Petsfolio Client App, pet parents can register themselves and their pets, discover\nverified service providers, book pet care services, monitor booking progress, make secure\nonline payments, manage wallet transactions, communicate with service providers, and\nmaintain complete records of their pets and service history.\nThe application serves as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals,\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5652]\nUser Management\n User Registration\n OTP-Based Authentication\n Profile Management\n Account Settings\nPet Management\n Add Pet Profiles\n Edit Pet Information\n Manage Multiple Pets\n Store Pet Details\nPet Care Services\nUsers can book the following professional pet care services through the application:\n Dog Walking\n Grooming\n Pet Training\n Pet Sitting\n Veterinary Consultation\n Pet Insurance\nEach service provides its own booking workflow, availability, pricing, and assigned service\nprovider.\nBooking Management\nThe booking system allows users to:\n Select a service.\n Choose one or more pets.\n Select service location.\n Schedule preferred date and time.\n Review pricing details.\n Confirm bookings.\n Track booking progress.\n View active bookings.\n Access completed booking history.\n Download invoices where applicable.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5601]\nCustomer Support can be accessed through the Support section of the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nService Provider Enquiries\nOverview\nPetsfolio welcomes experienced pet care professionals and businesses to join the platform as\nverified service partners. By registering through the Petsfolio - Service Partner app, you can\noffer professional pet care services to pet parents in your area.\nThe registration process includes profile creation, Aadhaar KYC verification, service selection,\nand approval by the Petsfolio verification team. Only verified and approved service partners can\nstart receiving customer booking requests.\nServices Available for Registration\nApplicants can register for one or more of the following services:\n Dog Walking\n Grooming\n Pet Sitting\n Pet Training\nRegistration Process\nTo become a Petsfolio Service Partner:\n1. Download the Petsfolio - Service Partner app from the Google Play Store.\n2. Register using your mobile number.\n3. Verify your mobile number using the OTP.\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5599]\nThe Petsfolio AI Assistant helps pet parents understand available insurance plans and make\ninformed decisions.\nUsers can ask questions about:\n Coverage options\n Policy duration\n Insurance benefits\n Eligibility\n Application process\n General insurance-related queries\nFor policy-specific assistance, the Petsfolio Pet Insurance Team will contact the pet parent after\nreviewing the submitted request.\nPet Insurance Frequently Asked Questions\n(FAQs)\nWhat is Petsfolio Pet Insurance?\nPetsfolio Pet Insurance provides financial protection against eligible medical expenses,\naccidents, illnesses, and other covered events through trusted insurance plans.\nWhich pets are supported?\nPet Insurance is available for both Dogs and Cats, subject to the insurer\'s eligibility criteria.\nDo I need to register before requesting a quote?\nYes. Users must register, complete OTP verification, and add at least one pet profile before\nrequesting a Pet Insurance quote.\nHow do I request a Pet Insurance quote?\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5597]\n Service Provider Assignment\n Booking Status Updates\n Service Completion\n Cancellations\n32. How can I contact Petsfolio Customer Support?\nYou can contact Petsfolio Customer Support through the support options available in the\nPetsfolio Client Application.\nTraining Service\nOverview\nThe Training Service enables pet parents to book professional pet training sessions conducted\nby verified Petsfolio trainers. The service connects users with experienced trainers who provide\npersonalized training programs based on the pet\'s age, breed, behavior, and learning\nrequirements.\nThe service is designed to improve obedience, behavior, socialization, and overall discipline\nwhile creating a positive learning experience for both pets and their owners.\nPetsfolio is committed to delivering safe, reliable, and high-quality pet care services through\ncertified and experienced trainers.\nEligibility\nThe Training Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5596]\nensuring convenience, transparency, reliability, and high-quality service delivery throughout the\ncustomer journey.\n1.2 Purpose\nThe purpose of the Petsfolio Client Application is to provide a centralized digital platform where\npet parents can conveniently manage every aspect of their pet\'s care without the need to\nsearch for multiple service providers individually.\nThe application enables users to:\n Register and securely access their account using OTP authentication.\n Create and manage multiple pet profiles.\n Discover verified and trusted pet service providers.\n Book pet care services based on their requirements.\n Schedule services for preferred dates and times.\n Track booking and service progress in real time.\n Communicate with assigned service providers.\n Make secure online payments.\n Manage wallet balance and transaction history.\n View booking history and invoices.\n Receive booking updates, reminders, and notifications.\n Earn loyalty rewards and promotional benefits.\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5596]\n Service coverage in the selected area.\nGrooming Service Summary\nSupported Pets\n Dog\n Cat\nGrooming Packages\n Basic Package\n Anti-Tick Bath Package\n Hair Trimming Package\nHair Trimming Styles\n Semi Trim\n Full Trim\n Stylish Trim\nOptional Add-On Services\n Ear Cleaning\n Anal Gland Cleaning\n Knot Removal\n De-shedding\n Nail Clipping\n Mouth Spray\n Body Massage\n Paw Massage\n Dash of Cologne\n Sanitary Clipping\n Eye Cleaning\n Teeth Cleaning\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5592]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: WhatsApp Contact | Phone: 917288909906 | Rep: Sahila\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): General Inquiry\r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: \r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hi\nCustomer: Hi\nAI Agent: Hi there! Welcome to Petsfolio. I\'m your AI assistant, here to help you with all your pet care needs. How can I assist you today?\nCustomer: Tell me about petsflo\nAI Agent: Petsfolio is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and enhance pet care management for pet parents. It offers a secure, user-friendly, and centralized digital ecosystem where you can manage your pets and access a wide range of professional pet care services. You can register yourself and your pets, discover verified service providers, book services, monitor progress, make secure payments, and maintain complete records of your pets and service history. It acts as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals, ensuring convenience, transparency, and reliability.\nCustomer: Wt service you offer\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"Petsfolio is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and enhance pet care management for pet parents. It offers a secure, user-friendly, and centralized digital ecosystem where you can manage your pets and access a wide range of professional pet care services. You can register yourself and your pets, discover verified service providers, book services, monitor progress, make secure payments, and maintain complete records of your pets and service history. It acts as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals, ensuring convenience, transparency, and reliability.\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Wt service you offer\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Sahila will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Wt service you offer', '```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Petsfolio offers a variety of professional pet care services to help you manage your pet\'s well-being. These include:\\n\\n*   *Grooming*: Professional grooming for dogs and cats to maintain hygiene, health, and appearance. Packages include Basic, Anti-Tick Bath, and Hair Trimming, with optional add-ons like ear cleaning and nail clipping.\\n*   *Dog Walking*: Scheduled walking sessions for your dog\'s daily exercise needs.\\n*   *Pet Training*: Personalized training programs for dogs to improve obedience and behavior.\\n*   *Pet Sitting*: Services to care for your pet when you\'re away.\\n*   *Veterinary Consultation*: Professional advice for your pet\'s health.\\n*   *Pet Insurance*: Financial protection against eligible medical expenses.\\n\\nTo explore and book these services, please download and use the *Petsfolio Client Application*.\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"General Inquiry\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User asked about the services offered by Petsfolio. The AI listed Grooming, Dog Walking, Pet Training, Pet Sitting, Veterinary Consultation, and Pet Insurance, and directed the user to the Petsfolio Client Application.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Direct user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n```', 'google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite', 3229, '2026-07-17 12:55:25', '2026-07-17 12:55:25'),
(106, 26, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.6051]\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5997]\n Support for multiple pets under a single account.\n Consistent pet information across all bookings and services.\nWalking Service (Regular)\nOverview\nThe Regular Walking Service enables pet parents to book professional dog walking services\nbased on their pet\'s daily exercise requirements. The service connects users with verified\nservice providers who offer scheduled walking sessions according to the selected package,\nfrequency, duration, and preferred timings.\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5935]\nThe service is designed to provide a safe, reliable, and convenient walking experience while\nallowing pet parents to customize their booking based on their pet\'s needs.\nEligibility\nThe Regular Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nBooking Process\nThe Regular Walking Service booking process includes the following steps:\n1. Select the registered pet.\n2. Choose the Regular Walking Service.\n3. Select the walking frequency.\n4. Select the preferred walk duration.\n5. Choose the walking package.\n6. Select the preferred schedule.\n7. Choose the service start date.\n8. Select the preferred service time.\n9. Choose optional add-on services (if required).\n10. Submit the booking request.\nOnce submitted, the request is shared with eligible nearby service providers for quotation.\nWalking Frequency\nUsers can choose one of the following walking frequencies:\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5901]\nCombing.\n4. Which pets are eligible for the Walking Service?\nCurrently, Walking Service is available only for registered Dogs.\n5. Do I need to register my pet before booking?\nYes. Your pet must be registered in the Petsfolio Client App before booking a walking service.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5885]\nWalk Duration\nEach walking session can be scheduled for:\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\nThe application offers multiple package durations:\nPackage 	Duration 	Price\nExpress Package 	3 Days 	195/walk\nShort-Term Package 	7 Days 	146/walk\nMid-Term Package 	15 Days 	125/walk\nLong-Term Package 	30 Days 	96/walk\nSchedule Options\nUsers can choose their preferred walking schedule:\n Weekdays\n All Days\nAdditional scheduling information includes:\n Service Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\nThe following add-on services are available during booking:\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5871]\nWalk Durations\n 30-Minute Walk Duration\n 60-Minute Walk Duration\nPackage Options\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\nSchedule Options\n Weekdays\n All Days\n Preferred Start Date\n Preferred Service Time\nOptional Add-On Services\n Poo Picking\n Paw Cleaning\n Combing\nRelated Features\n Service Provider Quotation\n Active Service Tracking\n Extend Service\n Replace Walker\n Cancel Service\n Booking Notifications\n Secure Online Payment\nElite Walking Service (Premium)\nOverview\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5855]\nOverview\nThe Cancel Service feature allows users to cancel an upcoming or active walking service\nwhenever required.\nCancellation Process\nTo cancel a service, users can:\n1. Open the active booking.\n2. Select the Cancel Service option.\n3. Provide a cancellation reason (if applicable).\n4. Submit the cancellation request.\nCancellation Policy\nCancellation requests are processed according to the Petsfolio cancellation policy.\nDepending on the booking stage and applicable terms:\n Eligible refunds are processed.\n Wallet adjustments are made where applicable.\n Booking status is updated accordingly.\nWalking Service Summary\nSupported Pet\n Dog\nWalking Frequencies\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5824]\n6. Can I book walking services for multiple pets?\nYes. You can book walking services for multiple registered pets.\n7. How do I book a Walking Service?\nSelect your registered pet, choose Regular or Elite Walking Service, select the frequency,\nduration, package, schedule, preferred start date, preferred time, optional add-ons, and\ncomplete the booking process.\n8. What walking frequencies are available?\n Once a Day\n Twice a Day\n Thrice a Day\n9. What walk durations are available?\n 30 Minutes\n 60 Minutes\n10. What packages are available in the Regular Walking\nService?\n Express Package (3 Days)\n Short-Term Package (7 Days)\n Mid-Term Package (15 Days)\n Long-Term Package (30 Days)\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.579]\nThe Elite Walking Service is a premium dog walking service designed for pet parents who prefer\nenhanced care, priority support, and exclusive service benefits. This service is provided\nexclusively by Petsfolio Certified and Verified Service Providers, ensuring a higher standard of\nprofessionalism, reliability, and service quality.\nUnlike the Regular Walking Service, the Elite Walking Service includes premium benefits such as\n24/7 customer support, Priority Matching with the most suitable service provider, and\ncomplimentary pet care add-ons. The service is designed to deliver a personalized and premium\nwalking experience for pets and their owners.\nEligibility\nThe Elite Walking Service is currently available only for Dogs registered in the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers must register their pet before booking the service.\nPremium Benefits\nEvery Elite Walking Service booking includes the following benefits:\n Petsfolio Certified & Verified Service Providers.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5713]\n Combing\nThese add-ons provide additional care during the walking session and can be selected based on\nthe pet parent\'s preferences.\nService Provider Quotation\nOverview\nAfter a walking service request is submitted, the Petsfolio platform automatically shares the\nrequest with nearby eligible and available service providers based on the selected service\nlocation.\nInterested service providers can review the booking request and submit their quotations\nthrough the application.\nQuotation Information\nEach quotation includes information that helps pet parents compare available service\nproviders, including:\n Service Cost\n Service Provider Profile\n Customer Ratings\n Completed Service History\n Verification Status\n Relevant Provider Information\nSelecting a Service Provider\nPet parents can review and compare all received quotations before confirming the booking.\nThe application allows users to compare:\n Pricing\n Ratings\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: WhatsApp Contact | Phone: 917288909906 | Rep: Sahila\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): General Inquiry\r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: \r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hi\nCustomer: Hi\nAI Agent: Hi there! Welcome to Petsfolio. I\'m your AI assistant, here to help you with all your pet care needs. How can I assist you today?\nCustomer: Tell me about petsflo\nAI Agent: Petsfolio is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and enhance pet care management for pet parents. It offers a secure, user-friendly, and centralized digital ecosystem where you can manage your pets and access a wide range of professional pet care services. You can register yourself and your pets, discover verified service providers, book services, monitor progress, make secure payments, and maintain complete records of your pets and service history. It acts as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals, ensuring convenience, transparency, and reliability.\nCustomer: Wt service you offer\nAI Agent: Petsfolio offers a variety of professional pet care services to help you manage your pet\'s well-being. These include:\n\n*   *Grooming*: Professional grooming for dogs and cats to maintain hygiene, health, and appearance. Packages include Basic, Anti-Tick Bath, and Hair Trimming, with optional add-ons like ear cleaning and nail clipping.\n*   *Dog Walking*: Scheduled walking sessions for your dog\'s daily exercise needs.\n*   *Pet Training*: Personalized training programs for dogs to improve obedience and behavior.\n*   *Pet Sitting*: Services to care for your pet when you\'re away.\n*   *Veterinary Consultation*: Professional advice for your pet\'s health.\n*   *Pet Insurance*: Financial protection against eligible medical expenses.\n\nTo explore and book these services, please download and use the *Petsfolio Client Application*.\nCustomer: Walking\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"Petsfolio offers a variety of professional pet care services to help you manage your pet\'s well-being. These include:\n\n*   *Grooming*: Professional grooming for dogs and cats to maintain hygiene, health, and appearance. Packages include Basic, Anti-Tick Bath, and Hair Trimming, with optional add-ons like ear cleaning and nail clipping.\n*   *Dog Walking*: Scheduled walking sessions for your dog\'s daily exercise needs.\n*   *Pet Training*: Personalized training programs for dogs to improve obedience and behavior.\n*   *Pet Sitting*: Services to care for your pet when you\'re away.\n*   *Veterinary Consultation*: Professional advice for your pet\'s health.\n*   *Pet Insurance*: Financial protection against eligible medical expenses.\n\nTo explore and book these services, please download and use the *Petsfolio Client Application*.\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Walking\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Sahila will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Walking', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Hi there!*\\n\\nPetsfolio offers two dog walking options:\\n\\n**Regular Walking Service**\\n- Eligible for registered *dogs* only (must be added in the app).\\n- Choose walking frequency: *Once a Day*, *Twice a Day* (or *Thrice a Day* for Elite).\\n- Walk durations: *30 minutes* or *60 minutes*.\\n- Packages: *Express* (3 days), *Short‑Term* (7 days), *Mid‑Term* (15 days), *Long‑Term* (30 days) with pricing per walk.\\n- Schedule: *Weekdays* or *All Days*; set start date and preferred time.\\n- Optional add‑ons: *Poo Picking*, *Paw Cleaning*, *Combing*.\\n\\n**Elite Walking Service (Premium)**\\n- Same features plus premium benefits: 24/7 support, priority matching, complimentary add‑ons, and certified providers.\\n\\nTo book, simply download the *Petsfolio Client Application*, register your dog, and follow the walking service booking steps.\\n\\nLet us know if you need anything else!\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"Walking Service Inquiry\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\"Walking Service\"],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"Provided overview of Regular and Elite dog walking services and booking steps.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"ProvideAppLink\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 3341, '20