(107, 26, 'You are Petsfolio\'s AI assistant.\r\n\r\nKNOWLEDGE BASE:\r\n[CHUNK 1 | score: 0.572]\nand submit feedback through the Petsfolio Client Application.\nSitting Service Frequently Asked Questions\n(FAQs)\nWhat is the Petsfolio Sitting Service?\n\n[CHUNK 2 | score: 0.5671]\nAbout Sitting Service\nThe Petsfolio Sitting Service connects pet parents with verified and experienced pet sitters\nthrough the Petsfolio Client Application. The service is designed to provide professional care for\npets when their owners are away, ensuring they receive proper attention, feeding,\ncompanionship, medication (if required), and routine care in a safe and comfortable\nenvironment.\nBefore booking a Sitting Service, users must download the Petsfolio Client Application, register\ntheir account, complete OTP verification, and add at least one pet profile.\nThe Sitting Service is available for both Dogs and Cats.\nTo book a Sitting Service, users select their pet, choose the preferred sitting package, select the\nstay duration by choosing the From Date and To Date, select the Preferred Time Slot, confirm\nthe service address, and submit the booking request.\nSitting Service Packages\nPetsfolio offers the following Sitting Service packages:\nOvernight Care – 1499/-\n 24 Hours\n\n[CHUNK 3 | score: 0.5651]\nthe service address, and submit the booking request.\nSitting Service Packages\nPetsfolio offers the following Sitting Service packages:\nOvernight Care – 1499/-\n 24 Hours\nDay Care Visit – 1199/-\n 10 Hours\nHourly Visit – 599/-\n 4 Hours\nUsers can select the package that best suits their pet\'s care requirements.\nService Provider Quotations\n\n[CHUNK 4 | score: 0.5601]\n To Date\n Preferred Time Slot\n Service Address\n Pet Details\n Assigned Service Provider Details\nA Call option is available to contact the assigned service provider directly.\nPet Care Tasks\nDuring the Sitting Service, the assigned service provider can manage the pet\'s daily care using\npredefined tasks.\nAvailable task categories include:\n Feeding\n Medication\n Walk\nThese tasks are optional and are provided at no additional cost.\nPet parents can add tasks only before the Sitting Service begins. Once the service has started,\nnew tasks cannot be added.\nDuring the service, the assigned sitter updates the completion status of each task.\nPet parents receive notifications and can review each completed task by choosing to:\n Approve\n Reject\nExtend Sitting Service\nPet parents can extend an ongoing Sitting Service without creating a new booking.\nTo request an extension, users select the preferred package and submit the extension request\nto the assigned service provider.\n\n[CHUNK 5 | score: 0.5543]\nPetsfolio Sitting Service connects pet parents with verified pet sitters who provide professional\ncare for pets while their owners are away.\nWhich pets are supported?\nSitting Service is available for both Dogs and Cats.\nDo I need to register before booking?\nYes. Users must register, complete OTP verification, and add at least one pet profile before\nbooking a Sitting Service.\nHow do I book a Sitting Service?\nSelect your pet, choose a sitting package, select the stay dates, choose the preferred time slot,\nconfirm the service address, submit the booking request, compare quotations, select a service\nprovider, and complete the payment.\nWhat Sitting Service packages are available?\nPetsfolio offers:\n Overnight Care (24 Hours)\n Day Care Visit (10 Hours)\n Hourly Visit (4 Hours)\nCan I choose my stay dates?\nYes. Users can select both the From Date and To Date during the booking process.\nCan I choose my preferred time slot?\n\n[CHUNK 6 | score: 0.5527]\nCan I replace my assigned sitter?\nYes. Users can request a replacement sitter if they are not satisfied with the assigned service\nprovider.\nCan I cancel my Sitting Service?\nYes. Sitting Services can be cancelled according to the applicable cancellation policy.\nCan I submit feedback after the service is completed?\nYes. Pet parents can review the completed service and submit feedback through the\napplication.\nCan I book Sitting Service for multiple pets?\nYes. Separate Sitting Service bookings can be created for each registered pet.\nIs Sitting Service available everywhere?\nNo. Sitting Service availability depends on the selected location and the availability of verified\nservice providers.\nWhat notifications will I receive?\nUsers receive notifications for booking confirmation, quotation updates, payment confirmation,\nservice provider assignment, task updates, task approvals, extension requests, booking status\nupdates, service completion, and cancellations.\n\n[CHUNK 7 | score: 0.5475]\nWhat tasks are available during the Sitting Service?\nAvailable task categories include:\n Feeding\n Medication\n Walk\nAre pet care tasks chargeable?\nNo. These tasks are optional and are provided at no additional cost.\nWhen can I add pet care tasks?\nTasks can only be added before the Sitting Service begins.\nCan I add tasks after the service has started?\nNo. Once the Sitting Service has started, new tasks cannot be added.\nCan I approve or reject completed tasks?\nYes. Pet parents receive notifications for completed tasks and can approve or reject each task\nthrough the application.\nCan I extend my Sitting Service?\nYes. Users can request an extension while the current service is active.\nWhen does the extended service begin?\nThe extended Sitting Service begins only after the current service has ended.\n\n[CHUNK 8 | score: 0.5465]\nremains active only until the end of that day.\nIf the pet parent wishes to continue with the same service request later, they can use the\nRepost / Reactivate Service option. Once the request is reactivated, it is shared again with\nnearby eligible Petsfolio service providers, who can submit fresh quotations based on their\ncurrent availability.\nThe pet parent can then review the new quotations, chat with service providers if required,\ncompare their profiles, ratings, reviews, and previous service details, and proceed with the\nbooking by completing the payment.\nActive Sitting Service\nOnce the booking is confirmed, it appears in the Active Services section of the Petsfolio Client\nApplication.\nUsers can view:\n Selected sitting package\n Stay Duration\n From Date\n\n[CHUNK 9 | score: 0.5435]\nYes. Users can choose their preferred time slot while booking the service.\nCan I receive quotations from multiple service providers?\nYes. Eligible service providers can submit quotations, allowing users to compare pricing and\nprovider details before confirming the booking.\nCan I chat with the service provider before booking?\nYes. Users can communicate with service providers through the in-app chat before confirming\nthe booking.\nCan I view the service provider\'s profile before booking?\nYes. Users can view service provider profiles, customer ratings, reviews, previous service\nphotos, and quotation details before selecting a sitter.\nWhere can I view my confirmed booking?\nConfirmed bookings appear in the Active Services section of the Petsfolio Client Application.\nWhat information is available in Active Sitting Service?\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\n\n[CHUNK 10 | score: 0.5329]\nUsers can view the selected package, stay duration, preferred time slot, service address, pet\ndetails, assigned service provider details, and booking status.\nCan I contact my assigned sitter?\nYes. A Call option is available within the booking details.\n\n\r\n\r\nLEAD CONTEXT:\r\nName: WhatsApp Contact | Phone: 917288909906 | Rep: Sahila\r\nAlready Collected:\r\n- Service (intent): Walking Service Inquiry\r\n- City: \r\n- Pet Type: Dog\r\n\r\nHISTORY:\r\nCustomer: Hi\nCustomer: Hi\nAI Agent: Hi there! Welcome to Petsfolio. I\'m your AI assistant, here to help you with all your pet care needs. How can I assist you today?\nCustomer: Tell me about petsflo\nAI Agent: Petsfolio is a comprehensive mobile platform designed to simplify and enhance pet care management for pet parents. It offers a secure, user-friendly, and centralized digital ecosystem where you can manage your pets and access a wide range of professional pet care services. You can register yourself and your pets, discover verified service providers, book services, monitor progress, make secure payments, and maintain complete records of your pets and service history. It acts as a bridge between pet parents and verified pet care professionals, ensuring convenience, transparency, and reliability.\nCustomer: Wt service you offer\nAI Agent: Petsfolio offers a variety of professional pet care services to help you manage your pet\'s well-being. These include:\n\n*   *Grooming*: Professional grooming for dogs and cats to maintain hygiene, health, and appearance. Packages include Basic, Anti-Tick Bath, and Hair Trimming, with optional add-ons like ear cleaning and nail clipping.\n*   *Dog Walking*: Scheduled walking sessions for your dog\'s daily exercise needs.\n*   *Pet Training*: Personalized training programs for dogs to improve obedience and behavior.\n*   *Pet Sitting*: Services to care for your pet when you\'re away.\n*   *Veterinary Consultation*: Professional advice for your pet\'s health.\n*   *Pet Insurance*: Financial protection against eligible medical expenses.\n\nTo explore and book these services, please download and use the *Petsfolio Client Application*.\nCustomer: Walking\nCustomer: Siting\nAI Agent: *Hi there!*\n\nPetsfolio offers two dog walking options:\n\n**Regular Walking Service**\n- Eligible for registered *dogs* only (must be added in the app).\n- Choose walking frequency: *Once a Day*, *Twice a Day* (or *Thrice a Day* for Elite).\n- Walk durations: *30 minutes* or *60 minutes*.\n- Packages: *Express* (3 days), *Short‑Term* (7 days), *Mid‑Term* (15 days), *Long‑Term* (30 days) with pricing per walk.\n- Schedule: *Weekdays* or *All Days*; set start date and preferred time.\n- Optional add‑ons: *Poo Picking*, *Paw Cleaning*, *Combing*.\n\n**Elite Walking Service (Premium)**\n- Same features plus premium benefits: 24/7 support, priority matching, complimentary add‑ons, and certified providers.\n\nTo book, simply download the *Petsfolio Client Application*, register your dog, and follow the walking service booking steps.\n\nLet us know if you need anything else!\nCustomer: Siting\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Hi there!*\n\nPetsfolio offers two dog walking options:\n\n**Regular Walking Service**\n- Eligible for registered *dogs* only (must be added in the app).\n- Choose walking frequency: *Once a Day*, *Twice a Day* (or *Thrice a Day* for Elite).\n- Walk durations: *30 minutes* or *60 minutes*.\n- Packages: *Express* (3 days), *Short‑Term* (7 days), *Mid‑Term* (15 days), *Long‑Term* (30 days) with pricing per walk.\n- Schedule: *Weekdays* or *All Days*; set start date and preferred time.\n- Optional add‑ons: *Poo Picking*, *Paw Cleaning*, *Combing*.\n\n**Elite Walking Service (Premium)**\n- Same features plus premium benefits: 24/7 support, priority matching, complimentary add‑ons, and certified providers.\n\nTo book, simply download the *Petsfolio Client Application*, register your dog, and follow the walking service booking steps.\n\nLet us know if you need anything else!\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Siting\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Sahila will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Siting', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Petsfolio Sitting Service* helps you care for your dog while you\'re away.\\n\\n**Available Packages**\\n- *Overnight Care* – 24 hrs – ₹1499\\n- *Day Care Visit* – 10 hrs – ₹1199\\n- *Hourly Visit* – 4 hrs – ₹599\\n\\n**How it works**\\n1. Download the *Petsfolio Client Application* and register.\\n2. Add at least one pet profile (your dog).\\n3. Choose the package, set the *From* and *To* dates, and pick a preferred time slot.\\n4. Confirm the service address and submit the booking request.\\n5. Compare quotations from verified sitters, chat with them, and select a provider.\\n6. Pay securely in‑app.\\n\\n**Pet care tasks (free)**\\n- *Feeding*\\n- *Medication*\\n- *Walk*\\nYou can add these tasks **before** the service starts. The sitter updates task status and you can *approve* or *reject* each completed task.\\n\\n**Flexibility**\\n- Request a *replacement sitter* if needed.\\n- *Cancel* according to the cancellation policy.\\n- *Extend* the current booking by selecting a new package; the extension begins after the original service ends.\\n- Submit *feedback* after completion.\\n\\nAll bookings appear in the **Active Services** section where you can view package details, stay duration, time slot, address, pet info, and assigned sitter.\\n\\n*To get started, download the Petsfolio Client Application from your app store and follow the steps above.*\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"Sitting Service Inquiry\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"Sitting Service\",\n    \"Dog\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"Provided details of Petsfolio Sitting Service packages, booking steps, free tasks, and flexibility options; guided user to download the app.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"ProvideAppLink\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 3893, '2026-07-17 12:56:39', '2026-07-17 12:56:39');
