g‑Term* (30 days) with pricing per walk.\n- Schedule: *Weekdays* or *All Days*; set start date and preferred time.\n- Optional add‑ons: *Poo Picking*, *Paw Cleaning*, *Combing*.\n\n**Elite Walking Service (Premium)**\n- Same features plus premium benefits: 24/7 support, priority matching, complimentary add‑ons, and certified providers.\n\nTo book, simply download the *Petsfolio Client Application*, register your dog, and follow the walking service booking steps.\n\nLet us know if you need anything else!\nCustomer: Siting\nAI Agent: *Petsfolio Sitting Service* helps you care for your dog while you\'re away.\n\n**Available Packages**\n- *Overnight Care* – 24 hrs – ₹1499\n- *Day Care Visit* – 10 hrs – ₹1199\n- *Hourly Visit* – 4 hrs – ₹599\n\n**How it works**\n1. Download the *Petsfolio Client Application* and register.\n2. Add at least one pet profile (your dog).\n3. Choose the package, set the *From* and *To* dates, and pick a preferred time slot.\n4. Confirm the service address and submit the booking request.\n5. Compare quotations from verified sitters, chat with them, and select a provider.\n6. Pay securely in‑app.\n\n**Pet care tasks (free)**\n- *Feeding*\n- *Medication*\n- *Walk*\nYou can add these tasks **before** the service starts. The sitter updates task status and you can *approve* or *reject* each completed task.\n\n**Flexibility**\n- Request a *replacement sitter* if needed.\n- *Cancel* according to the cancellation policy.\n- *Extend* the current booking by selecting a new package; the extension begins after the original service ends.\n- Submit *feedback* after completion.\n\nAll bookings appear in the **Active Services** section where you can view package details, stay duration, time slot, address, pet info, and assigned sitter.\n\n*To get started, download the Petsfolio Client Application from your app store and follow the steps above.*\nCustomer: Siting\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Petsfolio Sitting Service* helps you care for your dog while you\'re away.\n\n**Available Packages**\n- *Overnight Care* – 24 hrs – ₹1499\n- *Day Care Visit* – 10 hrs – ₹1199\n- *Hourly Visit* – 4 hrs – ₹599\n\n**How it works**\n1. Download the *Petsfolio Client Application* and register.\n2. Add at least one pet profile (your dog).\n3. Choose the package, set the *From* and *To* dates, and pick a preferred time slot.\n4. Confirm the service address and submit the booking request.\n5. Compare quotations from verified sitters, chat with them, and select a provider.\n6. Pay securely in‑app.\n\n**Pet care tasks (free)**\n- *Feeding*\n- *Medication*\n- *Walk*\nYou can add these tasks **before** the service starts. The sitter updates task status and you can *approve* or *reject* each completed task.\n\n**Flexibility**\n- Request a *replacement sitter* if needed.\n- *Cancel* according to the cancellation policy.\n- *Extend* the current booking by selecting a new package; the extension begins after the original service ends.\n- Submit *feedback* after completion.\n\nAll bookings appear in the **Active Services** section where you can view package details, stay duration, time slot, address, pet info, and assigned sitter.\n\n*To get started, download the Petsfolio Client Application from your app store and follow the steps above.*\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"Siting\"\r\n\r\nCRITICAL RULES:\r\n1. TONE & GREETING: Act as a friendly, helpful assistant. If this is the first message (HISTORY is (None)), warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio and greet them before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE ANSWERS: When the user asks for information about a service, provide the relevant details found in the Knowledge Base about that service, but keep your response strictly under 350 words. Be concise and do not overwhelm the user with too much information at once.\r\n3. GUIDANCE: After providing the information, direct the user to download and use the Petsfolio Client Application to book their service. Do NOT ask them if they are ready to book here or try to schedule it manually.\r\n4. NO FORCED QUALIFICATION: Do NOT ask the user for \'Pet Type\', \'City\', or any other missing data fields purely to collect data. Your goal is simply to assist them with their inquiries.\r\n5. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: Even though you won\'t ask for it, if the user naturally mentions their \'Pet Type\', \'City\', \'Intent\', etc., you MUST extract that info into the corresponding JSON fields so it can be saved.\r\n6. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER ask for Pet Name, Gender, Address, Dates/Times, Packages, Payment, Phone, Email, or OTP.\r\n7. SHARING LINKS: If the user asks for the app or if he mentions about booking a service, application, or website link, you MUST share the direct URLs exactly as provided in the Knowledge Base. You are fully authorized to share links.\r\n8. COMPLETION & HUMAN HANDOFF: If the user explicitly asks to speak with a human or if you cannot answer their question, let them know that Sahila will contact them shortly and set disableAI=true.\r\n9. OUTPUT: Respond purely via the structured JSON schema.\r\n10. FORMATTING: You are chatting on WhatsApp. Use WhatsApp markdown (*bold* for emphasis). NO HTML tags. Keep sentences short.\r\n\r\nYou must respond in JSON format ONLY matching this schema:\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your reply text\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Siting', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Petsfolio Sitting Service* offers professional care for your dog while you\'re away.\\n\\n**Packages**\\n- Overnight Care – 24 hrs – ₹1499\\n- Day Care Visit – 10 hrs – ₹1199\\n- Hourly Visit – 4 hrs – ₹599\\n\\n**How to book**\\n1. Download the *Petsfolio Client Application* from your app store and register.\\n2. Add your dog’s profile.\\n3. Choose a package, set the *From* and *To* dates, and pick a preferred time slot.\\n4. Confirm the service address and submit the request.\\n5. Review quotations from verified sitters, chat if needed, and select a provider.\\n6. Pay securely in‑app.\\n\\n**Free pet‑care tasks** (add before the service starts): Feeding, Medication, Walk. The sitter updates each task and you can approve or reject.\\n\\n**Flexibility**: request a replacement sitter, cancel per policy, or extend the booking (extension starts after the current service ends). After completion, you can submit feedback.\\n\\nAll active bookings appear in the *Active Services* section where you can view package details, dates, time slot, address, pet info, and assigned sitter.\\n\\n*Start now by downloading the Petsfolio app and following the steps above.*\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"Dog\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"Sitting Service Inquiry\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"Sitting Service\"\n  ],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User asked about sitting service for a dog. Provided package details, booking steps, free tasks, flexibility options, and instructed to download the Petsfolio app.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"Guide user to download the Petsfolio Client Application and book the sitting service.\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 4174, '2026-07-17 12:56:53', '2026-07-17 12:56:53'),
