CT OUTPUT FORMAT:\r\nYou MUST respond with ONLY a valid JSON object. No text before or after. No markdown fences. No explanation. Just the JSON.\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"reply\": \"Your WhatsApp reply text here\",\r\n  \"qualification\": {\r\n    \"petType\": \"\",\r\n    \"breed\": \"\",\r\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\r\n    \"city\": \"\",\r\n    \"intent\": \"\",\r\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\r\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\r\n    \"interestScore\": 5\r\n  },\r\n  \"tags\": [],\r\n  \"disableAI\": false,\r\n  \"summary\": \"\",\r\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\r\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\r\n  \"nextAction\": \"\",\r\n  \"triggerActions\": {\r\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\r\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\r\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\r\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\r\n  }\r\n}\n\nUser Message: Hi', '{\n  \"reply\": \"*Hi Vishal! Welcome to Petsfolio 🐾* How can I assist you today? Let me know which service you\'re interested in (Walking, Grooming, Training, Sitting, Boarding, or Pet Insurance).\",\n  \"qualification\": {\n    \"petType\": \"\",\n    \"breed\": \"\",\n    \"petAge\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"intent\": \"\",\n    \"specialRequirements\": \"\",\n    \"urgency\": \"Medium\",\n    \"interestScore\": 5\n  },\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"disableAI\": false,\n  \"summary\": \"User greeted and welcomed.\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Neutral\",\n  \"probabilityOfConversion\": 50,\n  \"nextAction\": \"await_user_response\",\n  \"triggerActions\": {\n    \"createFollowUp\": false,\n    \"followUpNotes\": \"\",\n    \"followUpDate\": \"\",\n    \"addNote\": \"\"\n  }\n}', 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 1632, '2026-07-18 11:04:41', '2026-07-18 11:04:41'),
