let me know!\nCustomer: Walking\nAI Agent: I see you\'re interested in our walking services! Please provide details about your dog, such as breed and city, to assist you better.\nCustomer: menu\nAI Agent: *Here\'s a summary of the services we offer at Petsfolio:* \n\n1. **Grooming Services** \n   - Basic Package \n   - Anti-Tick Bath Package \n   - Hair Trimming \n\n2. **Walking Services** \n   - 30-Minute or 60-Minute Walks \n   - Various packages based on duration \n\n3. **Training Services** \n   - Certified trainers available for dog training \n\nIf you\'re interested in any particular service or need assistance with booking, just let me know!\nCustomer: 18 july 2026\n\r\n\r\nLAST AGENT MSG: \"*Here\'s a summary of the services we offer at Petsfolio:* \n\n1. **Grooming Services** \n   - Basic Package \n   - Anti-Tick Bath Package \n   - Hair Trimming \n\n2. **Walking Services** \n   - 30-Minute or 60-Minute Walks \n   - Various packages based on duration \n\n3. **Training Services** \n   - Certified trainers available for dog training \n\nIf you\'re interested in any particular service or need assistance with booking, just let me know!\"\r\nUSER MSG: \"18 july 2026\"\r\n\r\nRULES:\r\n1. GREETING: If HISTORY is \"(None)\", warmly welcome the user to Petsfolio before assisting.\r\n2. CONCISE: Keep responses under 200 words. Short sentences. No walls of text.\r\n3. INTENT EXTRACTION: When the user mentions wanting a service (walking, grooming, training, sitting, boarding, pet insurance), your reply should briefly acknowledge their interest. Set the \"intent\" field in qualification to the exact service name (e.g., \"Walking\", \"Grooming\", \"Training\", \"Sitting\"). The booking flow will be handled separately — do NOT try to collect booking details, show numbered menus, or tell the user to download an app.\r\n4. PASSIVE EXTRACTION: If the user naturally mentions pet type, city, breed, etc., extract it into the JSON qualification fields.\r\n5. RESTRICTIONS: NEVER 