(7, 26547, 1, '0', 'Hello, how can I help you today?', '2026-04-08 13:24:55', NULL),
(8, 26547, 2, 'This is a test message.', NULL, '2026-04-08 13:25:25', NULL),
(9, 26547, 3, '0', 'I understand this is a test. Is there anything specific you\'d like to test?', '2026-04-08 13:25:55', NULL),
(10, 2903520, 1, '', 'Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio.  \nAm I speaking with Saiteja?  \nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-09 07:23:35', NULL),
(11, 2903520, 2, 'English. ', 'Nice, we will continue in English.\n\nSaiteja, I am calling as an onboarding and verification specialist from Petsfolio.\n\nFirst, can you please tell me what kind of pet services you offer?  \nFor example, boarding, walking, grooming, training, or anything else.', '2026-04-09 07:23:55', NULL),
(12, 2903520, 3, 'Walking service. ', 'Great, so you offer dog walking services.  \n\nHow many years of experience do you have with dog walking, and have you handled different breeds and sizes, like small, medium, and large dogs?', '2026-04-09 07:24:07', NULL),
(13, 2922532, 1, '', 'Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \n\nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-09 11:22:04', NULL),
(14, 2922532, 2, 'Kunjamana gap he vach kar raha. Telugu. ', 'ठीक है, कोई बात नहीं, मैं समझ गई कि अभी आप व्यस्त हैं।  \n\nक्या आप बता सकते हैं, अभी बात करना मुश्किल है क्या?  \nअगर हाँ, तो कृपया एक सही समय बता दीजिए, कब कॉल करना बेहतर रहेगा?', '2026-04-09 11:22:22', NULL),
(15, 2922532, 3, 'Naina matladu sunnadhi Telugu. ', 'సరే, మనం తెలుగు లోనే మాట్లాడుదాం.  \n\nఅదిత్య గారు, ఇప్పుడే మాట్లాడడానికి టైం ఉందా, లేదా మీరు బిజీగా ఉన్నారా?  \nమీకు సౌకర్యం ఉంటే, నేను ఆన్ బోర్డింగ్ కోసం కొద్దిగా వివరాలు మాత్రమే అడుగుతాను.  \nలేదంటే, మీకు ఏ టైం లో కాల్ చేయడం బాగుంటుందో చెబుతారా?', '2026-04-09 11:22:49', NULL),
(16, 2922532, 4, 'Aath hamla Malik call chhah tarah mera naam ko. ', 'సారీ అదిత్య గారు, మీ మాట పూర్తిగా అర్థం కాలేదు.  \n\nమనమిలా చేద్దాం.  \nముందు ఒకసారి మీ పేరు కన్ ఫర్మ్ చేసుకుంటాను.  \n\nమీరు అదిత్య గారే కదా?  \n\nఅలాగే, ఇప్పుడే మాట్లాడగలరా? లేక ఇంకో టైం లో కాల్ చేయమంటారా?', '2026-04-09 11:23:11', NULL),
(17, 2922532, 5, 'Personal name confirm Jess Kovanu. ', 'సరే, థ్యాంక్యూ చెప్పినందుకు.  \n\nముందుగా ఒక చిన్న కన్ ఫర్మేషన్ కోసం అడుగుతున్నాను.  \nమీ పేరు అదిత్య గారేనా? ఒకసారి స్పష్టంగా మీ', '2026-04-09 11:23:19', NULL),
(18, 2922532, 6, 'The name confirm Chase call Kadanuku. Hello. ', '', '2026-04-09 11:23:32', NULL),
(19, 2922532, 7, '', 'Hello again. This is Petsfolio calling.  \n\nAm I speaking with Adithya?  \n\nIf yes, please tell me clearly which language you want for this call.  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-09 11:23:34', NULL),
(20, 2922853, 1, 'Hello. ', 'Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-09 11:27:59', NULL),
(21, 2922853, 2, 'Yes. ', 'Thank you for confirming.  \n\nWhich language would you like to continue in for this call?  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-09 11:28:11', NULL),
(22, 2922853, 3, 'I choose English. English. ', 'Perfect, we will continue in English.\n\nAdithya, I am calling from Petsfolio for your onboarding as a pet service provider.  \nFirst, can you please tell me what kind of pet services you offer? For example, boarding, walking, grooming, training, or anything else.', '2026-04-09 11:28:37', NULL),
(23, 2922853, 4, 'English. Hello. ', 'Yes, we are speaking in English, no problem at all.\n\nAdithya, can you please tell me what pet services you provide?  \nFor example, do you offer boarding, walking, grooming, training, or something else?', '2026-04-09 11:28:52', NULL),
(24, 2922853, 5, '', 'Adithya, are you still on the line?  \nIf you are there, could you please tell me what pet services you provide, like boarding, walking, grooming, or training?', '2026-04-09 11:29:01', NULL),
(25, 2922853, 6, '', 'If you are there, could you please tell me what pet services you provide, like boarding, walking, grooming, or training? Would you like to continue our conversation?', '2026-04-09 11:29:10', NULL),
(26, 2922853, 7, 'Walking. ', 'Hi Adithya, I am here.  \n\nWe are speaking in English.  \nCan you please tell me what pet services you provide?  \nFor example, boarding, walking, grooming, or training.', '2026-04-09 11:29:20', NULL),
(27, 2937597, 1, 'Hello. Yes. ', 'Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \nCan you please confirm your name once?  \n\nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-10 06:37:59', NULL),
(28, 2937597, 2, '', 'Hi Adithya, are you still on the line?  \nShall we continue with the onboarding questions now?', '2026-04-10 06:38:09', NULL),
(29, 2937597, 3, '', 'Hi Adithya, are you still there on the call? If you are available, shall we continue now?', '2026-04-10 06:38:19', NULL),
(30, 2937597, 4, '', 'I\'ll leave you for now. Have a nice day!', '2026-04-10 06:38:38', NULL),
