(35, 2937728, 1, '', 'Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \n\nCan you please confirm your name once?  \n\nMay I know your preferred language for this call? You can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.', '2026-04-10 07:22:31', NULL),
