(6, '2922532', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2546550', '+918048799779', '+917095654315', '+918048799779', 'team.xhtmlchamps@gmail.com', '2026-04-09 11:23:40', 'completed', 102, 'outbound', 'bot', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/2922532?token=063b81d830b8f344f2bfc096ebe51c08', 'The conversation involves a call from Petsfolio to a user named Adithya, who is busy and switches between languages. The agent attempts to confirm Adithya\'s name and preferred language for the call.', 'Neutral', '[\'LLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \\n\\nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \\nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: Kunjamana gap he vach kar raha. \\nLLM: ठीक है, कोई बात नहीं, मैं समझ गई कि अभी आप व्यस्त हैं।  \\n\\nक्या आप बता सकते हैं, अभी बात करना मुश्किल है क्या?  \\nअगर हाँ, तो कृपया एक सही समय बता दीजिए, कब कॉल करना बेहतर रहेगा?\\nUser: Naina matladu sunnadhi Telugu. \\nLLM: సరే, మనం తెలుగు లోనే మాట్లాడుదాం.  \\n\\nఅదిత్య గారు, ఇప్పుడే మాట్లాడడానికి టైం ఉందా, లేదా మీరు బిజీగా ఉన్నారా?  \\nమీకు సౌకర్యం ఉంటే, నేను ఆన్ బోర్డింగ్ కోసం కొద్దిగా వివరాలు మాత్రమే అడుగుతాను.  \\nలేదంటే, మీకు ఏ టైం లో కాల్ చేయడం బాగుంటుందో చెబుతారా?\\nUser: Aath hamla Malik call chhah tarah mera naam ko. \\nLLM: సారీ అదిత్య గారు, మీ మాట పూర్తిగా అర్థం కాలేదు.  \\n\\nమనమిలా చేద్దాం.  \\nముందు ఒకసారి మీ పేరు కన్ ఫర్మ్ చేసుకుంటాను.  \\n\\nమీరు అదిత్య గారే కదా?  \\n\\nఅలాగే, ఇప్పుడే మాట్లాడగలరా? లేక ఇంకో టైం లో కాల్ చేయమంటారా?\\nLLM: \\nUser: The name confirm Chase call Kadanuku. \\nLLM: \\nLLM: Hello again. This is Petsfolio calling.  \\n\\nAm I speaking with Adithya?  \\n\\nIf yes, please tell me clearly which language you want for this call.  \\nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\n\']', '2026-04-09 11:23:44', '2026-04-09 16:53:44'),
(7, '2922853', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2546866', '+918048799779', '+917095654315', '+918048799779', 'team.xhtmlchamps@gmail.com', '2026-04-09 11:29:25', 'completed', 93, 'outbound', '0', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/2922853?token=0feed3cfae37294f24ed76d9c4f6f89d', 'The Agent, representing Petsfolio, confirms the User\'s identity and preferred language for onboarding as a pet service provider. The User indicates they offer walking services but provides limited information overall.', 'Neutral', '[\'LLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?  \\nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \\nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you for confirming.  \\n\\nWhich language would you like to continue in for this call?  \\nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: I choose English. \\nLLM: Perfect, we will continue in English.\\n\\nAdithya, I am calling from Petsfolio for your onboarding as a pet service provider.  \\nFirst, can you please tell me what kind of pet services you offer? For example, boarding, walking, grooming, training, or anything else.\\nUser: English. \\nLLM: Yes, we are speaking in English, no problem at all.\\n\\nAdithya, can you please tell me what pet services you provide?  \\nFor example, do you offer boarding, walking, grooming, training, or something else?\\nLLM: Adithya, are you still on the line?  \\nIf you are there, could you please tell me what pet services you provide, like boarding, walking, grooming, or training?\\nUser: Walking. \\nLLM: Hi Adithya, I am here.  \\n\\nWe are speaking in English.  \\nCan you please tell me what pet services you provide?  \\nFor example, boarding, walking, grooming, or training.\\n\']', '2026-04-09 11:29:30', '2026-04-09 16:59:30'),
