(13, '2937753', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2565168', '+918048799779', '+917095654315', '+918048799779', 'team.xhtmlchamps@gmail.com', '2026-04-10 07:28:11', 'completed', 103, 'outbound', 'user', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/2937753?token=d547207dd0711f2da7fb9121b5890b66', 'The conversation involves an agent onboarding Adithya as a pet service provider, specifically for grooming services. Adithya confirms his experience with both dogs and cats but does not specify the years of experience or sizes he handles clearly.', 'Neutral', '[\'LLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Adithya?\\n\\nCan you please confirm your name once?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you for confirming your name, Adithya.  \\n\\nMay I know your preferred language for this call?  \\nYou can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: English. \\nLLM: Thank you, Adithya, we will continue in English.\\n\\nI am calling from Petsfolio for your onboarding as a pet service provider.\\n\\nFirst, can you please tell me what pet services you offer?  \\nFor example, boarding, walking, grooming, training, or anything else.\\nUser: Grooming. \\nLLM: Nice, thank you for sharing that.  \\n\\nHow many years of experience do you have in pet grooming, and do you usually handle both dogs and cats, or only dogs?\\nUser: Both. \\nLLM: That is good to know, Adithya.  \\n\\nHow many years of experience do you have in grooming dogs and cats?  \\nAlso, do you handle all sizes and breeds, like small, medium, and large pets?\\nUser: No. \\nLLM: Alright, no problem.  \\n\\nCan you please tell me which sizes and breeds you are comfortable grooming? For example, only small breeds, or small and medium, and any specific breeds you prefer or avoid?\\nUser: Virender Sehwag. \\nLLM: I think there was a little confusion there.  \\n\\nI was asking about the sizes and breeds of pets you are comfortable grooming.  \\n\\nCan you please tell me  \\nDo you groom only small dogs and cats, or small and medium, or also large ones?  \\nAnd are there any specific breeds you do not want to handle, like very large or aggressive breeds?\\n\']', '2026-04-10 07:45:30', '2026-04-10 13:15:30'),
