  \\nనేను ఒక్క భాషలోనే మాట్లాడాలి. మిక్స్ చేయకూడదు.  \\nఇప్పుడే మీరు తెలుగు లో మాట్లాడారు కాబట్టి, నేను తెలుగు లోనే మాట్లాడాలి. ఇంగ్లీష్ కలపడానికి నాకు అనుమతి లేదు.  \\n\\nమీకు ఈజీగా ఉండాలంటే మనం ఇలా చేద్దాం  \\nనేను చాలా సింపుల్, స్లో తెలుగు లో మాట్లాడుతాను.  \\nమీకు ఏ మాట అర్థం కాకపోతే  \\nనువ్వు నాకే చెప్పు  \\nఅర్థం కాలేదు  \\nఅని.  \\nఅప్పుడు నేను ఇంకా సింపుల్ గా చెప్తాను.  \\n\\nఇప్పుడు మీరు చెప్పండి  \\nమీరు పెట్స్ గురించి ఇంక\\nUser: Hello. \\nLLM: Hello Adithya, I hear you.  \\n\\nRight now I can speak only in one language at a time.  \\nIf you want, we can switch fully to English.  \\n\\nWould you like to continue in English? Please say only  \\nEnglish  \\nor  \\nTelugu  \\nso I can set it properly.\\nLLM: Hello Adithya, I am here and I can hear you.  \\nWould you like to continue this call in English or in Telugu?  \\nPlease say only one word now  \\nEnglish  \\nor  \\nTelugu\\n\']', '2026-04-13 12:48:25', '2026-04-13 18:18:25'),
(25, '3105140', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2751389', '+918048799794', '+918758396038', '+918048799794', NULL, '2026-04-16 10:11:20', 'completed', 40, 'outbound', 'user', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/3105140?token=21128db9a8c172a37a805d15bf3fdd5a', 'The conversation is between an agent from Petsfolio and a user named Sahil Doi. The agent confirms the user\'s name and asks for their preferred language, which the user chooses as English, and inquires about the pet services offered and their experience.', 'neutral', '[\'LLM: नमस्ते, मैं Petsfolio से बोल रही हूँ। क्या मैं साहिल डोई से बात कर रही हूँ?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: साहिल डोई जी, अपना नाम कन्फर्म करने के लिए धन्यवाद। कृपया बताएं कि आप किस भाषा में बात करना पसंद करेंगे? आप अंग्रेज़ी, हिंदी, तेलुगु, तमिल, या कन्नड़ में से चुन सकते हैं।\\nLLM: कृपया बताएं कि आप किस भाषा में बात करना पसंद करेंगे? आप अंग्रेजी, हिंदी, तेलुगु, तमिल या कन्नड़ में से चुन सकते हैं।\\nUser: English. \\nLLM: Thank you for choosing English. Can you please tell me what pet services you offer? Also, how many years of experience do you have in this field?\\n\']', '2026-04-16 10:11:25', '2026-04-16 15:41:25'),
(26, '3119329', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2764870', '+918048799794', '+918758396038', '+918048799794', NULL, '2026-04-17 06:55:46', 'completed', 319, 'outbound', 'user', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/3119329?token=f87da5075ed641da8798557254d3d587', 'The conversation involves a verification call from Petsfolio to a user regarding their pet sitting services. The user provides information about their experience, availability, and handling of pets, and concludes with a request for the mobile app link.', 'positive', '[\"LLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with [provider_name]? Please stay on the line, I have a few quick questions for your verification.\\nUser: If you record your name and reason for calling, I will see if this person is available. \\nLLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with [provider_name]? Please stay on the line, I have a few quick questions for your verification.\\nUser: Am I speaking with provider and? \\nLLM: May I know your preferred language for this call? You can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: English. \\nLLM: Got it. How many years of experience do you have in pet sitting at home?\\nUser: 2 years of experience. \\nLLM: Thank you. Have you worked with different breeds and sizes of pets?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Understood. What days and times are you usually available for pet services?\\nUser: Old Ding. \\nLLM: I am sorry, I did not quite catch that. Could you please explain that in a different way?\\nUser: Fulltime. \\nLLM: Got it. Are you able to take urgent or last-minute bookings if needed?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Will you be able to go regularly for confirmed bookings?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you. How do you handle pets that are aggressive or anxious?\\nUser: By giving them credits. \\nLLM: Can you give me an example of how you have handled such a situation before?\\nUser: I have given treats to the pet. \\nLLM: Got it. How many pets can you accommodate at one time?\\nUser: 2 to 3. \\nLLM: Understood. Do you provide separate spaces for different pets if needed?\\nUser: I didn\'t understand. Can you please repeat it? \\nLLM: I am sorry, I did not quite catch that. Could you please explain that in a different way?\\nUser: Can you please repeat the question? \\nLLM: Certainly. Do you provide separate spaces for different pets if needed?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you. Do you allow owners to visit and inspect the space before boarding?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Understood. What would you do if two pets start fighting while boarding?\\nUser: I will make them come. \\nLLM: I am sorry, I did not quite catch that. Could you please explain that in a different way?\\nUser: I will make them both calm by giving them treat. \\nLLM: Got it. Do you have your ID proof and address proof ready for verification?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you. Do you have any questions about the Petsfolio platform?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Please go ahead with your questions.\\nUser: Please give me brief introduction of petrol. \\nLLM: \\nLLM: Petsfolio is a pet care company that offers premium dog walking, training, grooming, and boarding services. We focus on providing the best care for your pet and making them feel like part of the family. We have over fifty thousand happy customers and are known for professional pet masters, competitive prices, and a commitment to pets and owners. We also offer customized packages, a mobile app for service tracking, and secure payments.\\nLLM: \\nUser: Can you please share mobile link to download the app? \\nLLM: Hello, are you still there?\\nUser: Can you please share mobile link? To download the app. \\nLLM: I understand you\'re asking for the mobile app link, but for this call I can only assist with your verification. Shall we continue?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: Thank you so much for your time and for answering my questions. We will review your details and get back to you soon about the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\nUser: Okay. \\nLLM: Thank you so much for your time and for answering my questions. We will review your details and get back to you soon about the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\nUser: Thank you. Goodbye. \\nLLM: Thank you so much for your time and for answering my questions. We will review your details and get back to you soon about the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\n\"]', '2026-04-17 06:55:51', '2026-04-17 12:25:50'),
