 a situation before?\\nUser: By giving them treat. \\nLLM: Understood. On customer request, are you willing to pick up pet waste during walks?\\nUser: Sure, sure. Yes. \\nLLM: Got it. Do you clean the pet\'s paws after the walk if needed?\\nUser: Yes. \\nLLM: That\'s helpful. What would you do if a dog refuses to walk or becomes stubborn during the walk?\\nUser: I will make them come and give a treat. \\nLLM: \\n\"]', '2026-04-18 06:08:06', '2026-04-18 11:38:06'),
