 steps. Please keep your ID proof and address proof ready as they will be needed for the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\nUser: By diverting their mind.\\nLLM: Thank you so much for your time and for answering my questions. We will review your details and get back to you soon about the next steps. Please keep your ID proof and address proof ready as they will be needed for the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\n\"]', '2026-04-20 12:41:55', '2026-04-20 18:11:55'),
