(81, '3264902', '139674', 'Petsfolio Provider Verification & Onboarding Agent', '2914512', '+918048799794', '+917095654315', '+918048799794', NULL, '2026-04-20 12:55:20', 'completed', 115, 'outbound', 'bot', 'https://www.omnidim.io/api/v1/recording/3264902?token=55b473b5a64f730eb0159393988910f7', 'The conversation involved a verification call from Petsfolio to a user named Rupa, who confirmed her full-time availability and provided details on handling aggressive pets. The agent thanked Rupa for her time and informed her to prepare ID proof for the next steps.', 'positive', '[\"LLM: Hello, I am calling from Petsfolio. Am I speaking with Rupa?\\nUser: Yes.\\nLLM: Please stay on the line, I have a few quick questions for your verification. May I know your preferred language for this call? You can choose English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, or Kannada.\\nUser: I\'ll choose English.\\nLLM: Got it. Are you offering these services on a full-time or part-time basis?\\nUser: Full time.\\nLLM: Understood. How do you handle pets that are aggressive or anxious?\\nUser: I will handle them by using a leash and a mouth stick.\\nLLM: Can you give me an example of how you have handled such a situation before?\\nUser: I have handled some pets which are excessive. We\'ll give the tolls and while they are biting the tolls, we\'ll do the grooming.\\nLLM: Got it. Do you own your grooming tools and equipment?\\nUser: Yes, I do.\\nLLM: Understood. What would you do if a pet becomes aggressive during grooming?\\nUser: I\'ll make sure to come down while doing the grooming. I\'ll divert it.\\nLLM: Thank you so much for your time and for answering my questions. We will review your details and get back to you soon about the next steps. Please keep your ID proof and address proof ready as they will be needed for the next steps. Have a wonderful day.\\n\"]', '2026-04-20 12:55:26', '2026-04-20 18:25:26');
