(28, 1, NULL, 29, 'admin', 'Fun & Contest 🎉🐶\r\nPets bring joy, and sharing that joy makes it even more special. Fun activities and contests allow you to showcase your pet’s personality and creativity. Whether it’s cute photos, tricks, or funny moments, every entry is a chance to celebrate your bond. Participating helps you connect with a wider pet-loving community and creates lasting memories. It’s not about winning—it’s about enjoying the experience and letting your pet shine. These moments bring happiness not just to you, but to others as well. Join in, have fun, and give your pet the spotlight they truly deserve every day.', 'text', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'public', 1, 0, '2026-05-04 12:00:00', 'scheduled', '2026-05-04 11:20:07', '2026-05-04 11:25:16'),
(29, 11, NULL, 30, 'admin', 'Admin Post', 'text', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 'public', 0, 1, NULL, 'deleted', '2026-05-04 11:25:16', '2026-05-04 11:37:33'),
